  {t="TRAIN", seg=2, text="Maximillian Crowe, in the basement of the inn: level 8 spells if you are 8 (Curse of Agony, Fear). Put Curse of Agony on every enemy after Corruption. Fear the second enemy whenever two come, but never near other packs: a feared enemy runs and brings friends back", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=44.4, y=66.2},
  {t="N", seg=2, arg="Make Linen Bandages from your Linen Cloth", text="Sell and repair at the smithy before you go to the lake"},
  {t="A", seg=2, q={99127}, names={"A Net Disaster"}, text="Jason Mathers, one of the two fishermen on the west shore of Crystal Lake, just east of Goldshire", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=47.4, y=62.3},
  {t="A", seg=2, q={99143}, names={"Bottles and Baubles"}, text="Lee Brown, next to him", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=47.5, y=62.3},
  {t="C", seg=2, q={99127}, names={"A Net Disaster"}, text="Check the fishing traps in the shallow water of Crystal Lake (their spots are not published: look for traps along the shore and in the shallows, starting at the fishermen) until you have 7 Half-Eaten Fish", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=50.5, y=65.5},
  {t="C", seg=2, q={99143,112}, names={"Bottles and Baubles","Collecting Kelp"}, text="The murloc camp is on the east shore, across the lake. Pick up 6 Shiny Junk from the camp and kill Murlocs and Murloc Streamrunners (6-7) for 4 Crystal Kelp Fronds. Kill 7 Murlocs and 4 Streamrunners while you are here: Jason asks for exactly that next. Murlocs run for help at low health: keep Corruption on every one so a runner dies on the way, and Shadow Bolt it as it turns. Do not Fear in the camp: a feared murloc brings the others", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=54.2, y=66.7},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={99127}, names={"A Net Disaster"}, text="Jason Mathers", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=47.5, y=62.3},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={99143}, names={"Bottles and Baubles"}, text="Lee Brown", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=47.4, y=62.2},
  {t="A", seg=2, q={99128}, names={"Slimy Menace"}, text="Jason Mathers: Slimy Menace. If he offers a different quest, take that one and follow its text", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=47.5, y=62.3},
  {t="C", seg=2, q={99128}, names={"Slimy Menace"}, text="Back across the lake: 7 Murlocs and 4 Murloc Streamrunners. Kills from before you had the quest do not count", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=54.2, y=66.7},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={99128}, names={"Slimy Menace"}, text="Jason Mathers", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=47.4, y=62.2},
  {t="A", seg=2, q={99129}, names={"A Man About a Murloc"}, text="Jason Mathers", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=47.4, y=62.2},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={99129}, names={"A Man About a Murloc"}, text="Remy \"Two Times\", in Goldshire", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=42.1, y=67.1},
  {t="A", seg=2, q={99130}, names={"An Enticing Offer"}, text="Remy \"Two Times\"", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=42.1, y=67.1},
  {t="A", seg=2, q={40}, names={"A Fishy Peril"}, text="Remy \"Two Times\" (needs level 7)", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=42.1, y=67.3},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={40}, names={"A Fishy Peril"}, text="Marshal Dughan", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=42.1, y=65.9},
  {t="A", seg=2, q={35}, names={"Further Concerns"}, text="Marshal Dughan. Guard Thomas is at the bridge in the east: next segment", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=42.1, y=65.9},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={112}, names={"Collecting Kelp"}, text="William Pestle, in the inn", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=43.3, y=65.7},
  {t="A", seg=2, q={114}, names={"The Escape"}, text="William Pestle", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=43.3, y=65.7},
  {t="C", seg=2, q={99130}, names={"An Enticing Offer"}, text="Duskweed grows in the fields on both sides of the road south of Goldshire and on the farms (18 petals); the 6 Vials of Animal Blood drop from the wolves, boars and bears you meet on the way", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=41.5, y=74.6},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={114}, names={"The Escape"}, text="Maybell Maclure, in the barn at the Maclure Vineyards", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=43.2, y=89.6, path={{40.6,77.4},{42.8,78.9},{44.6,82.5},{44.6,87.9}}},
  {t="C", seg=2, q={99130}, names={"An Enticing Offer"}, text="Finish the petals and the blood on the walk back north", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=40.0, y=69.6, path={{44.6,87.9},{44.6,82.5},{42.8,78.9},{39.8,76.2}}},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={99130}, names={"An Enticing Offer"}, text="Remy \"Two Times\", in Goldshire", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=42.1, y=67.1},
  {t="A", seg=2, q={99131}, names={"Baited for Success"}, text="Remy \"Two Times\". Jason is on your way east: you hand it in at the start of the next segment", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=42.1, y=67.1},
  {t="N", seg=2, arg="Sell, repair and make bandages in Goldshire", text="Next: the east of Elwynn. Everything there is level 8-10"},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={99131}, names={"Baited for Success"}, text="Jason Mathers, the fisherman on the west shore of Crystal Lake", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=47.4, y=62.2},
  {t="N", seg=3, arg="Follow the road east from Goldshire to the Tower of Azora", text="About four minutes. The tower stands on a hill south of the road; the gnome Blixie stands at the foot of the hill, beside the road", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=63.3, y=72.7, path={{49.0,62.1},{50.4,60.0},{55.0,60.0},{58.2,61.8},{59.6,63.9},{60.4,69.6}}},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={91725}, names={"Stolen Enchanting Supplies"}, text="Blixie Fitzwink. The gnoll camps are at Stone Cairn Lake: later in this segment", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=63.3, y=72.7},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={91723}, names={"Delicate Instruments"}, text="Hamish Bergwort, in the Tower of Azora", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=65.0, y=69.8},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={76}, names={"The Jasperlode Mine"}, text="Go north across the road and up the valley to the Jasperlode Mine. Walk in until \"Scout through the Jasperlode Mine\" ticks", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=60.2, y=49.2, path={{61.5,53.1}}, cave=true},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={91723}, names={"Delicate Instruments"}, text="Kill 8 Kobold Geomancers (7-8) in and in front of the mine. They cast fire, so kill them fast: Immolate, Corruption, Curse of Agony, then Shadow Bolt with the Imp helping. Fear a second kobold when two come, but only where no other kobolds stand near. Mine Spiders (8-9) hang further in: leave the deep tunnels alone", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=61.4, y=53.0, path={{61.5,53.1}}, cave=true},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={91723}, names={"Delicate Instruments"}, text="Hamish Bergwort, back in the Tower of Azora", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=65.0, y=69.8},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={91724}, names={"Delicate Instruments"}, text="Hamish Bergwort: the second Delicate Instruments (Defias Rogue Wizards at Stone Cairn Lake)", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=65.0, y=69.8},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={35}, names={"Further Concerns"}, text="Follow the road east to the bridge: Guard Thomas", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=74.0, y=72.2, path={{67.6,66.6},{71.0,66.9}}},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={37}, names={"Find the Lost Guards"}, text="Guard Thomas", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=74.0, y=72.2},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={52}, names={"Protect the Frontier"}, text="Guard Thomas", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=74.0, y=72.2},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={46}, names={"Bounty on Murlocs"}, text="Guard Thomas", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=74.0, y=72.2},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={91733}, names={"Downstream"}, text="Ormin Pelford, at the tipped wagon just past the bridge", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=76.5, y=72.0},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={5545}, names={"A Bundle of Trouble"}, text="Supervisor Raelen, at the Eastvale Logging Camp, north-east of the bridge", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=81.4, y=66.1},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={91732}, names={"Good Steel"}, text="Hagar Lowe, at the camp", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=82.4, y=63.9},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={83}, names={"Red Linen Goods"}, text="Sara Timberlain, in the house on the south side of the camp. The Red Linen Bandanas drop from the Defias wizards you kill at the lake", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=79.5, y=68.8},
  {t="N", seg=3, arg="Sell and repair at the camp", text="Rallic Finn sells bows and repairs. Horses are sold here too: this is where you come for your mount at level 40"},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={5545}, names={"A Bundle of Trouble"}, text="Bundles of Wood lie at the foot of the trees all round the logging camp, mostly north of it: pick up 8", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=80.1, y=60.6},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={52}, names={"Protect the Frontier"}, text="Kill 8 Prowlers (9-10; around the camp and north of it) and 5 Young Forest Bears (8-9; in the woods south of the road, back toward the tower). Finish the bears later on the walk back if you are short", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=80.5, y=66.7},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={5545}, names={"A Bundle of Trouble"}, text="Supervisor Raelen, at the logging camp: hand the wood in now, you are standing next to him and do not come back for a while", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=81.4, y=66.1},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={37}, names={"Find the Lost Guards"}, text="Follow the east bank of the river north. A half-eaten body lies on the ground", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=72.7, y=60.3, path={{77.3,65.1},{74.2,67.2},{72.0,63.9}}},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={45}, names={"Discover Rolf's Fate"}, text="From the body", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=72.7, y=60.3},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={45}, names={"Discover Rolf's Fate"}, text="Rolf's corpse lies in the middle of the murloc camp on the east shore of Stone Cairn Lake. Murloc Foragers and Lurkers (9-10) stand close together and run for help: pull the outer ones back one at a time, Corruption and Curse of Agony on each so a runner dies on the way. Do not Fear at the camp: a feared murloc brings the rest", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=79.8, y=55.5},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={71}, names={"Report to Thomas"}, text="From the corpse", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=79.8, y=55.5},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={46}, names={"Bounty on Murlocs"}, text="Kill murlocs around the camp until you have 8 Torn Murloc Fins", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=78.0, y=57.0},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={91724}, names={"Delicate Instruments"}, text="North and north-west of the murloc camp, around the north-east shore: kill 6 Defias Rogue Wizards (9-10). They cast frost spells that slow you: fight one at a time, kill it fast with all your DoTs and Shadow Bolt, and Fear the second. Keep every Red Linen Bandana", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=74.0, y=50.0},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={83}, names={"Red Linen Goods"}, text="Keep killing wizards until you have 6 Red Linen Bandanas", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=74.0, y=50.0},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={91725}, names={"Stolen Enchanting Supplies"}, text="Collect 5 Stolen Enchanting Supplies from the gnoll camps around the lake. Their exact spots are not published: the Riverpaw camps are on the north and west shores. Look for crates or sacks in the camps", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=70.0, y=46.0},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={91732}, names={"Good Steel"}, text="West from the lake to the Jasperlode Mine: pick up 4 Mining Tools inside. Their spots are not published (the quest says \"in the depths\"): go in as far as you safely can, one kobold or spider at a time. If the tools are only among the spiders at the very back and that is too much, press Skip here and on the hand-in", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=61.0, y=50.5, path={{61.5,53.1}}, cave=true},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={91724}, names={"Delicate Instruments"}, text="South to the Tower of Azora: Hamish Bergwort", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=65.0, y=69.8},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={91725}, names={"Stolen Enchanting Supplies"}, text="Blixie Fitzwink, at the foot of the hill", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=63.2, y=72.6},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={52}, names={"Protect the Frontier"}, text="Finish the 5 Young Forest Bears in the woods south of the road on the way east", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=66.0, y=75.0},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={71}, names={"Report to Thomas"}, text="Guard Thomas, at the bridge", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=74.0, y=72.2, path={{66.2,76.2},{67.6,76.2},{72.8,70.8}}},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={39}, names={"Deliver Thomas' Report"}, text="Guard Thomas", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=74.0, y=72.2},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={52}, names={"Protect the Frontier"}, text="Guard Thomas", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=74.0, y=72.2},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={46}, names={"Bounty on Murlocs"}, text="Guard Thomas", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=74.0, y=72.2},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={91732}, names={"Good Steel"}, text="Hagar Lowe", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=82.4, y=63.8, path={{75.3,74.4},{77.9,74.1},{79.3,70.8},{79.7,65.7}}},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={83}, names={"Red Linen Goods"}, text="Sara Timberlain", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=79.5, y=68.8},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={91733}, names={"Downstream"}, text="Downstream: the Waterlogged Axe, Saw and Toolbox washed down the river south of the bridge, toward the murloc huts where the stream forks. Their spots are not published. Per TUGs the saw and the toolbox can be picked up without a fight, and the axe is guarded by two murlocs: Fear one, kill the other", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=78.0, y=73.0},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={91733}, names={"Downstream"}, text="Ormin Pelford, by the wagon at the bridge", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=76.4, y=72.0},
  {t="H", seg=3, arg="Goldshire", text="Hearthstone to the inn"},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={76}, names={"The Jasperlode Mine"}, text="Marshal Dughan", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=42.1, y=65.9},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={239}, names={"Westbrook Garrison Needs Help!"}, text="Marshal Dughan. Westbrook Garrison is in the west: next segment", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=42.1, y=65.9},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={39}, names={"Deliver Thomas' Report"}, text="Marshal Dughan. Do not take Cloth and Leather Armor: it only sends you back to Eastvale", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=42.1, y=65.9},
  {t="L", seg=3, lvl=10, text="Not 10 yet? Kill Defias Bandits and boars south of Goldshire until you are: Gakin's Summons, your warlock quest, needs level 10", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=46.0, y=70.0},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=3, text="Maximillian Crowe, in the basement of the inn: level 10 spells (Drain Soul, Create Healthstone). Drain Soul as the killing blow gives a Soul Shard; a Healthstone costs one. Keep 3-5 shards from now on: the next segment needs them", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=44.4, y=66.2},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={1685}, names={"Gakin's Summons"}, text="Remen Marcot, in the same basement (needs level 10): Gakin's Summons. It sends you to the Slaughtered Lamb in Stormwind for your Voidwalker: next segment", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=44.5, y=66.3},
  {t="N", seg=3, arg="Sell, repair and make bandages", text="Buy food and drink. The next segment goes to Stormwind, passes through Goldshire once more on the way to the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch, and then goes on to Loch Modan"},
  {t="N", seg=4, arg="Walk the road north-west from Goldshire into Stormwind", text="Three minutes. Go through the Valley of Heroes and over the bridge into the Trade District", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=63.2, y=74.4},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={61}, names={"Shipment to Stormwind"}, text="Morgan Pestle, in the shop on the south side of the Trade District", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=63.2, y=74.4},
  {t="S", seg=4, arg="Stormwind", text="Make the inn in the Trade District your home (the Gilded Rose). You hearth back here from the east of Elwynn in a little while", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=60.5, y=75.2},
  {t="F", seg=4, arg="Stormwind", text="Dungar Longdrink, the gryphon master, a few steps east of the inn", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=71.0, y=72.5},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={1685}, names={"Gakin's Summons"}, text="Gakin the Darkbinder, in the cellar of the Slaughtered Lamb: the tavern in the Mage Quarter, in the south-west of the city. Go through the back room and down the stairs", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=39.2, y=85.2},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={1688}, names={"Surena Caledon"}, text="Gakin the Darkbinder: Surena Caledon. She is back in the east of Elwynn", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=39.2, y=85.2},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=4, text="The warlock trainers (Demisette Cloyce, Ursula Deline, Sandahl) stand in the same cellar: anything you did not learn in Goldshire. Buy food and drink in the city before you leave", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=39.2, y=85.0},
  {t="N", seg=4, arg="Walk back out of Stormwind, through Goldshire and along the road east to the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch", text="About ten minutes. Sell and repair in Goldshire as you pass. The patch is south of the road, a little south-east of the Tower of Azora. On the way finish two or three kills with Drain Soul: you need a Soul Shard for a Healthstone now and one for the Voidwalker later", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=69.8, y=78.6},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={1688}, names={"Surena Caledon"}, text="Surena Caledon (level 9) stands in the farmhouse with Erlan Drudgemoor (8) and Morgan the Collector (10). You only need Surena's Choker. Prepare: Imp out, full health and mana, a Healthstone in your bags, and kill any Defias walking outside near the house so nothing joins in and nobody stands in the way of a Fear. Stand outside the door at maximum range, pull Surena with Shadow Bolt and back away from the house so they come out to you; with luck only one or two come. If all three come, Fear Morgan the Collector (the strongest) at once and again each time he returns. Corruption and Curse of Agony on the other two, then Immolate and Shadow Bolt on Surena until she is down, Erlan Drudgemoor next, Morgan last. Loot the choker as soon as Surena is dead. Going wrong? Use the Healthstone, Fear whoever is hitting you and run north to the road: they give up after a short chase. Eat, drink and pull again: whoever you killed stays dead for a few minutes", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=71.0, y=80.8},
  {t="H", seg=4, arg="Stormwind", text="Hearthstone back to the inn in the Trade District (you bound it there on this visit). On cooldown? Walk the road west, about ten minutes"},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={1688}, names={"Surena Caledon"}, text="Gakin the Darkbinder, in the cellar of the Slaughtered Lamb", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=39.2, y=85.2},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={1689}, names={"The Binding"}, text="Gakin the Darkbinder: The Binding. He gives you the Bloodstone Choker", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=39.2, y=85.2},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={1689}, names={"The Binding"}, text="Go further down, to the Summoning Circle at the bottom of the cellar. Full health and mana, Imp out. Stand at the circle and use the Bloodstone Choker from your bags, then defeat the Summoned Voidwalker: Immolate, Corruption, Curse of Agony, then Shadow Bolt", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=39.1, y=84.4},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={1689}, names={"The Binding"}, text="Gakin the Darkbinder. You learn Summon Voidwalker: summon it now (it costs one Soul Shard). The Voidwalker is your pet from here on: send it in first, let it hold the enemy for a moment, then Corruption, Curse of Agony, Immolate", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=39.2, y=85.2},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={91736}, names={"Applejack Still"}, text="Leave Stormwind by the main gate, turn right (west) off the road and follow the city wall past Mirror Lake: the Applejack Still stands a little west of the lake. It wants the 4 Shiny Red Apples you bought at the Stonefield Farm. No apples? The gnolls further south drop them: come back, or skip this step and the next three", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=24.5, y=58.2},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={91736}, names={"Applejack Still"}, text="Put the apples in: you get a bottle of Thunder Applejack", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=24.5, y=58.2},
  {t="N", seg=4, arg="Defias Rogue Wizards stand in the orchard beside Mirror Lake", text="They are level 9-10 and you no longer need them: walk around them"},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={91738}, names={"An Apple Treat"}, text="Go south to Westbrook Garrison, the guard post on the road to Westfall: Sergeant De Vries", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=24.0, y=73.0},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={91738}, names={"An Apple Treat"}, text="Hand him the Thunder Applejack", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=24.0, y=73.0},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={239}, names={"Westbrook Garrison Needs Help!"}, text="Deputy Rainer, in front of the garrison", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=24.2, y=74.4},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={11}, names={"Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty"}, text="Deputy Rainer", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=24.2, y=74.5},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={11}, names={"Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty"}, text="Forest's Edge, the woods south of the garrison: Riverpaw Runts and Outrunners (8-10) camp there. Collect 8 Painted Gnoll Armbands. Send the Voidwalker at one gnoll, then DoT it; Fear a second one only at the edge of a camp. Finish a few with Drain Soul to keep 3-5 Soul Shards. Stay in the northern camps: Hogger (11, elite) walks the hill at the far south end (26, 91); if you see him, move away. A gnoll may drop a Gold Pickup Schedule: it starts a quest for Goldshire that this route does not return for, so sell it or leave it", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=26.0, y=85.0},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={11}, names={"Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty"}, text="Deputy Rainer, at the garrison", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=24.2, y=74.5},
  {t="N", seg=4, arg="Walk back up the road into Stormwind", text="Buy food, drink and anything else you need in the city: the next real town is Thelsamar. No trainer visit is needed. Level 12 already? Then the Slaughtered Lamb is an optional stop for Health Funnel (it heals your Voidwalker) and the new ranks; otherwise you train in Ironforge next segment"},
  {t="N", seg=4, arg="Take the Deeprun Tram to Ironforge", text="The tram entrance is in the Dwarven District, in the north-east of Stormwind. Leave the rat quest on the far platform for the next segment: it runs the other way", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=66.0, y=34.0},
  {t="F", seg=4, arg="Ironforge", text="Gryth Thurden, the gryphon master in the centre of the city", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=55.5, y=47.7},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={95212}, names={"Never Saddle on Quality"}, text="Leave Ironforge by the main gate, go down the ramp and follow the road east to Amberstill Ranch (about four minutes): Rudra Amberstill. The pelts come from the leopards east of the quarry, together with the trogg quests", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=63.1, y=49.7},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={96392}, names={"Farsen's Watch"}, text="Earthseer Farsen's campsite is on the hillside south of the ranch, overlooking the Gol'Bolar Quarry from the west. Dwarves are sent to him from Kharanos; whether he gives his quests without that errand is not known. If he offers nothing, press Skip on this step and on his other five steps below", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=64.9, y=58.4},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={96392}, names={"Farsen's Watch"}, text="Talk to Farsen again and ask for his far sight; watch the vision until the objective ticks", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=64.8, y=58.4},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={96392}, names={"Farsen's Watch"}, zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=64.9, y=58.4},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={96390}, names={"Nip 'Em in the Bud"}, text="Farsen: 10 Dark Iron Spies at Ironband's Compound, east of the quarry", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=64.9, y=58.4},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={432}, names={"Those Blasted Troggs!"}, text="Foreman Stonebrow, at the Gol'Bolar Quarry camp, just east of Farsen's hill", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=69.1, y=56.3},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={433}, names={"The Public Servant"}, text="Senator Mehr Stonehallow, next to him", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=68.7, y=56.0},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={95214}, names={"Stolen Blasting Powder"}, text="Quarrymaster Thesten, on the north side of the camp. If he offers nothing, kill troggs until one drops an Empty Powder Keg, right-click it and bring it to him first (a small extra quest)", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=69.1, y=54.9},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={432}, names={"Those Blasted Troggs!"}, text="Rockjaw Skullthumpers (8-9) fill the quarry pit right beside the camp: kill 6. Every trogg here can drop Stolen Blasting Powder", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=70.3, y=55.9},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={433,95214,95212}, names={"The Public Servant","Stolen Blasting Powder","Never Saddle on Quality"}, text="Work east out of the quarry: kill 10 Rockjaw Bonesnappers (9-10) and keep killing troggs until you have 16 Stolen Blasting Powder. The big snow leopards on the slopes east and south-east of the quarry (70-78, 50-63) drop the 6 Pristine Leopard Pelts. Troggs stand close together: send the Voidwalker at one, DoT it, and Fear the second when two come", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=73.6, y=55.4},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={96390}, names={"Nip 'Em in the Bud"}, text="Ironband's Compound, the walled yard south-east of the quarry: kill 10 Dark Iron Spies (9-10). They are stealthed around the buildings and open on you in melee: walk slowly with the Voidwalker beside you, send it at a spy the moment one appears, then Corruption, Curse of Agony, Immolate. Eat and drink to full between fights", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=77.5, y=60.8},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={96391}, names={"Underground Map"}, text="One of the spies drops a Dark Iron Map: right-click it in your bags to start this quest. No map after 10 spies? Kill a few more", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=77.5, y=60.8},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={432}, names={"Those Blasted Troggs!"}, text="Foreman Stonebrow, back at the quarry camp", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=69.1, y=56.3},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={433}, names={"The Public Servant"}, text="Senator Mehr Stonehallow", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=68.7, y=56.0},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={95214}, names={"Stolen Blasting Powder"}, text="Quarrymaster Thesten. Sell and repair at the camp", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=69.1, y=54.9},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={96390}, names={"Nip 'Em in the Bud"}, text="Earthseer Farsen, on the hillside west of the quarry", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=64.9, y=58.4},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={96391}, names={"Underground Map"}, text="Farsen. Do NOT take his next quest (Old Ironforge Incursion): it is a dungeon", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=64.9, y=58.4},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={95212}, names={"Never Saddle on Quality"}, text="Rudra Amberstill, at Amberstill Ranch north of Farsen's camp", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=63.0, y=49.8},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={419}, names={"The Lost Pilot"}, text="Follow the road east past the quarry and take the left (northern) branch to North Gate Outpost: Pilot Hammerfoot", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=83.9, y=39.2},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={419}, names={"The Lost Pilot"}, text="A Dwarven Corpse lies in the snow west of the outpost, on the slope north of the road", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=79.7, y=36.2},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={417}, names={"A Pilot's Revenge"}, text="From the corpse", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=79.7, y=36.2},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={417}, names={"A Pilot's Revenge"}, text="Mangeclaw (level 11 bear) prowls right next to the corpse. Full health and mana first: send the Voidwalker in, give it a moment to hold him, then Corruption, Curse of Agony, Immolate and Shadow Bolt. Loot the Mangy Claw", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=78.3, y=37.8},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={417}, names={"A Pilot's Revenge"}, text="Pilot Hammerfoot, back at North Gate Outpost", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=83.9, y=39.2},
  {t="N", seg=4, arg="Walk to Loch Modan", text="Back to the fork and take the southern branch east to South Gate Outpost, then go through the South Gate Pass tunnels", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=86.0, y=51.0},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={224}, names={"In Defense of the King's Lands"}, text="Mountaineer Cobbleflint is at the guard tower in the Valley of Kings, just past the last tunnel", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=22.1, y=73.1},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={267}, names={"The Trogg Threat"}, text="Captain Rugelfuss, inside the tower", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=23.2, y=73.7},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={224}, names={"In Defense of the King's Lands"}, text="Stonesplinter Valley, the trogg hills east of the tower: kill 10 Stonesplinter Troggs and 10 Stonesplinter Scouts (11-12). Every trogg can drop a Trogg Stone Tooth", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=30.8, y=68.2},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={267}, names={"The Trogg Threat"}, text="Finish 8 Trogg Stone Teeth on any troggs on the way back to the tower", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=30.8, y=70.0},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={224}, names={"In Defense of the King's Lands"}, text="Mountaineer Cobbleflint, at the southern guard tower", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=22.1, y=73.1},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={267}, names={"The Trogg Threat"}, text="Captain Rugelfuss", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=23.2, y=73.7},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={237}, names={"In Defense of the King's Lands"}, text="Mountaineer Gravelgaw, a little south of the tower", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=23.5, y=76.4},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={237}, names={"In Defense of the King's Lands"}, text="Kill 10 Stonesplinter Skullthumpers and 10 Stonesplinter Seers (13-14) in the hills further south. They are above your level: one at a time, the Voidwalker in first on the Skullthumpers, then all your DoTs; the Seers heal and a warlock cannot interrupt, so kill a Seer first and fast, or Fear it while you kill the other. Health Funnel keeps the Voidwalker up once you are 12. Too hard at 12? Do the north of the zone first and come back for this before you leave", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=33.0, y=76.0},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={237}, names={"In Defense of the King's Lands"}, text="Mountaineer Gravelgaw", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=23.5, y=76.4},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={263}, names={"In Defense of the King's Lands"}, text="Mountaineer Wallbang, at the tower. Keep it: the Shamans and Bonesnappers are level 15-16, for your next Loch Modan visit", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=23.5, y=74.5},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={416,1339}, names={"Rat Catching","Mountaineer Stormpike's Task"}, text="Follow the road north-east to Thelsamar: Mountaineer Kadrell patrols the main street", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=34.2, y=47.8},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={418}, names={"Thelsamar Blood Sausages"}, text="Vidra Hearthstove, in the inn (Stoutlager Inn). Do NOT bind here: your hearthstone stays in Stormwind", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=34.8, y=49.3},
  {t="F", seg=4, arg="Thelsamar", text="Thorgrum Borrelson, the gryphon master on the south side of town"},
  {t="N", seg=4, arg="Grenhild Darktalon in Thelsamar offers Snowbound (a jar of snow from the South Gate Pass to the north shore). Skip it: it does not fit this loop"},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={418}, names={"Thelsamar Blood Sausages"}, text="On the way north kill Elder Black Bears (Bear Meat), Mountain Boars (Boar Intestines) and Forest Lurkers (Spider Ichor) beside the road: 3 of each item", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=31.5, y=39.0},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={1339}, names={"Mountaineer Stormpike's Task"}, text="Mountaineer Stormpike, at the top of the northern guard tower (Algaz Station), in the north-west corner of the zone", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=24.8, y=18.4},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={307,1338}, names={"Filthy Paws","Stormpike's Order"}, text="Stormpike gives both. Keep Stormpike's Order: it goes to Stormwind next segment", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=24.8, y=18.4},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={307,416}, names={"Filthy Paws","Rat Catching"}, text="Silver Stream Mine, the kobold cave east of the tower. Open 4 Miners' League Crates inside for the Miners' Gear and cut 12 Tunnel Rat Ears from any kobold. The Geomancers cast fire: kill them first, and Fear a second kobold if two come, but only where the tunnel behind it is already cleared", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=35.5, y=24.3, path={{35.3,18.7}}, cave=true},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={307}, names={"Filthy Paws"}, text="Back west to Mountaineer Stormpike", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=24.8, y=18.4},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={418}, names={"Thelsamar Blood Sausages"}, text="Finish the sausage meats on the walk back south to Thelsamar", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=33.0, y=31.5},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={416}, names={"Rat Catching"}, text="Mountaineer Kadrell, in Thelsamar", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=34.2, y=47.8},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={418}, names={"Thelsamar Blood Sausages"}, text="Vidra Hearthstove, in the inn. Sell and repair: the next segment starts with the gryphon from Thelsamar to Ironforge", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=34.8, y=49.3},
  {t="FLY", seg=5, arg="Ironforge", text="From Thorgrum Borrelson in Thelsamar"},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=5, text="Briarthorn, the warlock trainer in the Forlorn Cavern in the north of the city: learn your level 14 spells. Drain Life is the new one; take everything he offers. The demon trainer beside him sells the Voidwalker's spell books. Sell, repair, buy food and water, then walk on to Tinker Town on the east side for the tram", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=50.4, y=5.7},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={2039}, names={"Find Bingles"}, text="Gnoarn, in Tinker Town, right by the tram entrance (needs level 12). Keep it: Bingles is on the east shore of the Loch, next segment", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=69.2, y=50.6},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={96394}, names={"The Restless Dead"}, text="Afadra Dunwall. Kill 15 Enraged Apparitions and 10 Tormented Souls and put the spirit of Anvilmar to rest.", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=33.1, y=47.9, dg=1},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={96403}, names={"Important Heirlooms"}, text="Thom Filch. Collect 8 Dwarven Heirlooms inside.", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=32.4, y=44.8, dg=1},
  {t="N", seg=5, arg="Optional dungeon: Hall of Thanes, levels 13-18", text="The entrance is beneath Old Ironforge. Inside: the Ghostly Attendant gives An Ancient Grudge, and a stone tablet behind the vault door of the last room (easy to walk past on the way to the exit lever) starts The Treaty of Understanding for King Magni. Earthseer Farsen (Dun Morogh 64.9, 58.4) gives Old Ironforge Incursion, but only after the Underground Map quest from a Dark Iron Map item. Quests you picked up for it: The Restless Dead, Important Heirlooms.", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=27.6, y=47.8, dg=1, run=true},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={96394}, names={"The Restless Dead"}, zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=33.3, y=47.7, dg=1},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={96403}, names={"Important Heirlooms"}, zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=32.4, y=44.9, dg=1},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={6661}, names={"Deeprun Rat Roundup"}, text="Enter the Deeprun Tram through the big doorway in Tinker Town. Monty stands on the Ironforge platform between the tracks"},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={6661}, names={"Deeprun Rat Roundup"}, text="Use the Rat Catcher's Flute on 5 Deeprun Rats on and around the platform; they follow you. Walk them back to Monty"},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={6661}, names={"Deeprun Rat Roundup"}, text="Monty"},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={6662}, names={"Me Brother, Nipsy"}},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={6662}, names={"Me Brother, Nipsy"}, text="Ride the tram to the Stormwind end. Nipsy stands on that platform"},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={1338}, names={"Stormpike's Order"}, text="Furen Longbeard, in the Dwarven District, where the tram lets you out", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=64.6, y=37.2},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={97894}, names={"Business in Auberdine"}, text="Borgus Steelhand, in the Dwarven District (needs level 13). Just a message for his brother in Auberdine: you carry it until the route gets there by boat", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=59.4, y=34.3},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={2040}, names={"Underground Assault"}, text="Shoni the Shilent. The Gnoam Sprecklesprocket drops from Sneed's Shredder.", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=55.5, y=12.5, dg=2},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={399}, names={"Humble Beginnings"}, text="Baros Alexston, in Cathedral Square", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=57.7, y=47.9},
  {t="N", seg=5, arg="Buy 1 Shiny Bauble and 3 Nightcrawlers from Catherine Leland, the fishing supplier on the canal just west of the Trade District (Stormwind City 55.1, 69.8). They are for the old fisherman at the harbor"},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={97234}, names={"Reading Room"}, text="Roy Lewells, in the Park on the west side of the city (needs level 13)", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=38.7, y=62.2},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={95065}, names={"Fishin' Time"}, text="Gilbert Gray, fishing at the harbor on the far west side", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=26.3, y=47.1},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={95065}, names={"Fishin' Time"}, text="Hand him the bauble and the nightcrawlers right away", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=26.3, y=47.1},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={97220}, names={"Philmor's Favor"}, text="Manifest Clerk Philmor, at the docks north of Gilbert (follow the arrow). If he offers nothing, skip this quest and Gatehouse Goods", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=30.4, y=29.1},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={97234}, names={"Reading Room"}, text="Cross the city to Stormwind Keep: Donyal Tovald, the librarian, in the keep's library", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=75.2, y=30.3},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={97237}, names={"Shelf Picked"}, zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=75.2, y=30.3},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={97237}, names={"Shelf Picked"}, text="Find the four books on the shelves and tables of the library: Field Accounts of Horde Razings, Trollbane Conquests, The Forsaken Ally and Cycles of Morality. Keep the quest: Roy gets them when you come back from Westfall", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=75.2, y=30.3},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={168}, names={"Collecting Memories"}, text="Wilder Thistlenettle. 4 Miners' Union Cards from the undead miners in the tunnels before the dungeon portal.", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=65.4, y=21.2, dg=2},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={167}, names={"Oh Brother. . ."}, text="Wilder Thistlenettle. The badge drops from Foreman Thistlenettle, in the tunnels before the portal.", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=65.4, y=21.2, dg=2},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={97220}, names={"Philmor's Favor"}, text="Elaine Trias, in Trias' Cheese in the Trade District", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=66.6, y=73.5},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={97222}, names={"Gatehouse Goods"}, text="Elaine Trias", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=66.6, y=73.5},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={97222}, names={"Gatehouse Goods"}, text="Carry the Gatehouse Shipment up the stairs inside the cheese shop and put it down outside the stockroom door on the upper floor", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=66.6, y=73.5},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={97222}, names={"Gatehouse Goods"}, text="Elaine Trias", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=66.6, y=73.5},
  {t="F", seg=5, arg="Stormwind", text="Dungar Longdrink, the gryphon master in the Trade District. You fly back here from Westfall"},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={1097}, names={"Elmore's Task"}, text="Leave by the main gate and follow the road south to Goldshire: Smith Argus, in the smithy. Keep it for Grimand Elmore in Stormwind at the end of the segment", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=41.7, y=65.5},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={64}, names={"The Forgotten Heirloom"}, text="Take the road west from Goldshire, past Westbrook Garrison and over the bridge into Westfall. Farmer Furlbrow stands at a cart just past the bridge", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=60.0, y=19.4},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={109}, names={"Report to Gryan Stoutmantle"}, text="Farmer Furlbrow", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=60.0, y=19.4},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={36,151}, names={"Westfall Stew","Poor Old Blanchy"}, text="Verna Furlbrow, next to him", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=59.9, y=19.4},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={36}, names={"Westfall Stew"}, text="Follow the road south to Saldean's Farm: Salma Saldean, in the farmhouse", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.4, y=30.5},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={38,22}, names={"Westfall Stew","Goretusk Liver Pie"}, text="Salma gives both", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.4, y=30.5},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={9}, names={"The Killing Fields"}, text="Farmer Saldean, outside by the field", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.0, y=31.2},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={92909}, names={"Harvesting the Harvesters"}, text="Ozwin Ironsprocket, a gnome hiding in the stable west of the Saldean farmhouse", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=51.6, y=32.2},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={109}, names={"Report to Gryan Stoutmantle"}, text="Gryan Stoutmantle, in the stone tower on Sentinel Hill", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.3, y=47.5, path={{49.6,34.3},{49.6,37.9},{53.4,40.6},{55.4,43.6},{55.4,47.2}}},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={12}, names={"The People's Militia"}, text="Gryan Stoutmantle", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.3, y=47.5},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={102}, names={"Patrolling Westfall"}, text="Captain Danuvin, next to Gryan", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.4, y=47.6},
  {t="F", seg=5, arg="Sentinel Hill", text="Thor, the gryphon master just south of the tower"},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={153}, names={"Red Leather Bandanas"}, text="Scout Galiaan, south-west of the tower, near the inn", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=54.0, y=53.0},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={92742,92744}, names={"Testing the Wells","Murloc Gills"}, text="Alba Fairmoon, by the inn. She gives both and a Well Water Sample Kit", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=52.5, y=53.1},
  {t="S", seg=5, arg="Sentinel Hill", text="Make the inn your home: talk to Innkeeper Heather"},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={92909}, names={"Harvesting the Harvesters"}, text="Head west into the fields around the Alexston Farmstead. Harvest Golems and Harvest Watchers drop the Golem Isosprings (14) and Harvester Gyrostabilizers (5), and also Okra for the stew and Flasks of Oil: keep 5 oil for the lighthouse. Watchers count for the Saldeans (20). Kill Goretusks for livers and snouts and Fleshrippers for Stringy Vulture Meat wherever you see them, and open every Sack of Oats (8 needed) on the farms. Harvesters hit hard: send the Voidwalker first and let it hold one, then Corruption, Curse of Agony, Immolate and wand. Health Funnel keeps the Voidwalker up, Drain Life keeps you up; eat and drink between pulls. Drain Soul a last hit now and then: keep 3-5 Soul Shards for the Voidwalker and a Healthstone", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=39.0, y=50.0},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={92910}, names={"Harvesting the Harvesters"}, text="A harvester drops a Precessive Autocognition Assembly: right-click it in your bags to start this quest. If none has dropped by the time the parts are done, never mind", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=39.0, y=50.0},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={92742}, obj={2}, names={"Testing the Wells"}, text="North to the Molsen Farm (the position is approximate: it is the farm with harvesters north of the Alexston fields). Stand at the well in the yard and use the Well Water Sample Kit. Keep killing Harvest Watchers in its fields", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=44.0, y=35.0},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={12}, names={"The People's Militia"}, text="Kill 15 Defias Trappers and 15 Defias Smugglers (11-13). They stand around the Molsen Farm, the Jangolode Mine to the north and Furlbrow's Pumpkin Farm. They drop Red Leather Bandanas (15 needed in all, from any Defias). Riverpaw gnolls up here drop Gnoll Paws (8). Send the Voidwalker first, then Corruption, Curse of Agony and Immolate. Defias run at low health and bring friends: with your DoTs on them they die on the way, a Shadow Bolt helps. Fear a second one only where no other Defias stands near: a feared mob brings friends too", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=45.0, y=26.0},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={64}, names={"The Forgotten Heirloom"}, text="Furlbrow's Pumpkin Farm, east of the mine: the pocket watch is in the wardrobe inside the farmhouse. Defias inside: pull them out one at a time and let the Voidwalker hold each", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=49.3, y=19.3},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={92744}, names={"Murloc Gills"}, text="The coast north of the pumpkin farm (Longshore): kill murlocs (11-14) for 7 Longshore Murloc Gills and 3 Murloc Eyes. They come in twos and flee at low health: pull them back to the grass, away from the other murlocs. The Voidwalker holds the first; Fear the second only up there on the grass, never on the beach, where it runs into the next camp. Keep Corruption and Curse of Agony on both so a runner dies on the way. If these murlocs drop no gills, the map marks the west coast instead (24-28, 32-72): get them at the Gold Coast Quarry in loop 2 and hand in then", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=48.3, y=9.5},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={92742}, obj={1}, names={"Testing the Wells"}, text="East to the Jansen Stead, the farm beside the Furlbrows' cart (position approximate): use the Sample Kit at its well", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=59.0, y=18.0},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={151}, names={"Poor Old Blanchy"}, text="8 Handfuls of Oats from the Sacks of Oats on the farms. Missing some? The Jansen Stead and the pumpkin farm have several", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.0, y=20.0},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={64}, names={"The Forgotten Heirloom"}, text="Farmer Furlbrow, at the cart by the bridge", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=60.0, y=19.4},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={151}, names={"Poor Old Blanchy"}, text="Verna Furlbrow", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=59.9, y=19.4},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={9,22,38}, names={"The Killing Fields","Goretusk Liver Pie","Westfall Stew"}, text="On the way south to Saldean's Farm finish 20 Harvest Watchers (the fields west of the farm), 8 Goretusk Livers and the stew: 3 Stringy Vulture Meat, 3 Goretusk Snouts, 3 Murloc Eyes, 3 Okra", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=52.0, y=30.0},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={9}, names={"The Killing Fields"}, text="Farmer Saldean", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.0, y=31.2},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={22,38}, names={"Goretusk Liver Pie","Westfall Stew"}, text="Salma Saldean", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.4, y=30.5},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={92909}, names={"Harvesting the Harvesters"}, text="Ozwin Ironsprocket, in the stable. Parts missing? More harvesters stand in the fields right here", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=51.6, y=32.2},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={92910}, names={"Harvesting the Harvesters"}, text="Ozwin Ironsprocket (only if you found the Assembly). Do not start his engineering quest", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=51.6, y=32.2},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={92742,92744}, names={"Testing the Wells","Murloc Gills"}, text="Alba Fairmoon", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=52.5, y=53.1},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={92745}, names={"The State of the Mines"}, zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=52.5, y=53.1},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={12}, names={"The People's Militia"}, text="Gryan Stoutmantle", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.3, y=47.5},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={13}, names={"The People's Militia"}, zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.3, y=47.5},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={92745}, obj={1}, names={"The State of the Mines"}, text="North-west to the Jangolode Mine: kill 4 Kobold Diggers (12-13) inside", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=45.3, y=20.0, path={{55.4,47.2},{55.4,43.6},{53.4,40.6},{49.6,37.9},{49.0,33.1},{50.0,31.6},{50.0,28.0},{48.0,23.5},{48.0,19.0},{45.6,18.1}}},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={92745}, obj={2}, names={"The State of the Mines"}, text="South-west to the Gold Coast Quarry on the west coast: kill 6 Riverpaw Miners (14-15) in the quarry. The gnolls here drop Gnoll Paws", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=29.8, y=48.1, path={{45.0,18.4},{42.8,18.7},{38.2,23.2},{37.4,25.6},{37.8,31.6},{35.0,36.1},{35.6,45.1},{30.8,46.6}}},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={13}, names={"The People's Militia"}, text="Kill 15 Defias Pillagers and 15 Defias Looters (13-15) around the Gold Coast Quarry and the Alexston Farmstead just east of it. Pillagers cast Fireball and a warlock has no interrupt: kill them first, Voidwalker on the Pillager, all three DoTs and the wand, Drain Life when you are hurt. Fear the Looter that comes with one only if nothing else stands near. Finish the bandanas and gnoll paws here too", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=31.3, y=49.3},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={399}, names={"Humble Beginnings"}, text="Alexston Farmstead: A Simple Compass is in Alexston's Chest at the farmstead (follow the arrow)", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=36.2, y=54.5},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={102,153}, names={"Patrolling Westfall","Red Leather Bandanas"}, text="Still short of 8 Gnoll Paws (Riverpaw gnolls at the quarry) or 15 Red Leather Bandanas (any Defias)? Finish them before heading back east", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=34.0, y=50.0},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={102}, names={"Patrolling Westfall"}, text="Captain Danuvin, in the tower", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.4, y=47.6},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={13}, names={"The People's Militia"}, text="Gryan Stoutmantle", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.3, y=47.5},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={14,65}, names={"The People's Militia","The Defias Brotherhood"}, text="Gryan gives both. Keep The Defias Brotherhood: Wiley is in Lakeshire, next segment. Do not take the Deadmines quests", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.3, y=47.5},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={153}, names={"Red Leather Bandanas"}, text="Scout Galiaan", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=54.0, y=53.0},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={92745}, names={"The State of the Mines"}, text="Alba Fairmoon", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=52.5, y=53.1},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={92747}, names={"Moonbrook Espionage"}, zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=52.5, y=53.1},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={92747}, names={"Moonbrook Espionage"}, text="Moonbrook, the ruined town in the south-west: collect 8 Suspicious Industrial Supplies (crates and barrels in and between the buildings; their spots are not in our data). The town is full of Defias: clear a building before you loot in it, Voidwalker first, and do not Fear in town: a feared Defias comes back with others", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=42.5, y=70.0},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={14}, names={"The People's Militia"}, text="The Dagger Hills, south of Moonbrook: kill 15 Defias Highwaymen (17-18), 5 Pathstalkers and 5 Knuckledusters (15-17). They are above your level and stand in pairs: pull from as far away as you can so they come to you, away from the next pair. The Voidwalker takes the first; Fear the second once it is well clear of the next pair, then Corruption, Curse of Agony and Immolate on the first and Drain Life when you are hurt. Keep Health Funnel for the Voidwalker and a Healthstone in your bags, fight at full health and mana, eat and drink after every pull. Walk away if a third joins. Level 17 makes this much easier, so take your time", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=45.7, y=76.3},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={103}, names={"Keeper of the Flame"}, text="Captain Grayson, the ghost at the Westfall Lighthouse on the island off the south-west tip (swim across). Skip his murloc quest: it needs murlocs from the north coast", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=30.0, y=86.0},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={103}, names={"Keeper of the Flame"}, text="Hand in the 5 Flasks of Oil at once. Short of oil? Harvest Golems in the fields north of Moonbrook drop it", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=30.0, y=86.0},
  {t="H", seg=5, arg="Sentinel Hill"},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={92747}, names={"Moonbrook Espionage"}, text="Alba Fairmoon", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=52.5, y=53.1},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={92748}, names={"Explosive Consultation"}, zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=52.5, y=53.1},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={14}, names={"The People's Militia"}, text="Gryan Stoutmantle", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.3, y=47.5},
  {t="N", seg=5, arg="Optional dungeon: The Deadmines, levels 17-26", text="The entrance is in Moonbrook, in the south-west of Westfall: through the barn-like building and down the mine tunnels to the portal. Inside: Edwin VanCleef drops An Unsent Letter that starts a quest for Baros Alexston in Stormwind. Quests you picked up for it: Collecting Memories, Oh Brother. . ., Underground Assault. Needs an earlier quest chain this route does not do: Red Silk Bandanas, The Defias Brotherhood.", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=42.5, y=71.7, dg=2, run=true},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={214}, names={"Red Silk Bandanas"}, zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.7, y=47.3, dg=2},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={166}, names={"The Defias Brotherhood"}, zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.3, y=47.5, dg=2},
  {t="FLY", seg=5, arg="Stormwind", text="Thor, south of the tower"},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=5, text="The Slaughtered Lamb, the tavern in the Mage Quarter, on your way from the gryphon master to the Park. The warlock trainers (Demisette Cloyce, Ursula Deline, Sandahl) are in the cellar: learn your level 16 spells. Unending Breath is the new one; take everything they offer", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=39.2, y=85.0},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={97237}, names={"Shelf Picked"}, text="Roy Lewells, in the Park on the west side, just north of the Mage Quarter", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=38.7, y=62.2},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={399}, names={"Humble Beginnings"}, text="Baros Alexston, in Cathedral Square", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=57.7, y=47.9},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={1097}, names={"Elmore's Task"}, text="Grimand Elmore, in the Dwarven District", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=59.7, y=33.8},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={353}, names={"Stormpike's Delivery"}, text="Keep it: the package goes to Mountaineer Stormpike in Loch Modan", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=59.7, y=33.8},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={92748}, names={"Explosive Consultation"}, text="Sprite Jumpsprocket, an engineer in the Dwarven District. Stop here: her next quest needs 10 Rough Dynamite and the chain ends in the Deadmines", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=62.0, y=30.8},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={168}, names={"Collecting Memories"}, zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=65.4, y=21.2, dg=2},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={167}, names={"Oh Brother. . ."}, zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=65.4, y=21.2, dg=2},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={2040}, names={"Underground Assault"}, zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=55.5, y=12.5, dg=2},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={244}, names={"Encroaching Gnolls"}, text="From the Dwarven District leave Stormwind by the main gate and follow the road east: Goldshire, Eastvale Logging Camp, then the Three Corners crossroads just inside Redridge. Guard Parker walks the road there.", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=10.2, y=71.5},
  {t="F", seg=6, arg="Lakeshire", text="Follow the road north-east to Lakeshire. Ariena Stormfeather, the gryphon master, stands on the south side of the bridge. Redridge Mongrels (15-16) and Great Goretusks sit next to the road: leave them for now.", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=25.5, y=59.4},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={244}, names={"Encroaching Gnolls"}, text="Deputy Feldon, a few steps from the gryphon master", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=25.6, y=60.0},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={246}, names={"Assessing the Threat"}, text="Deputy Feldon", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=25.6, y=60.0},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={98407}, names={"Show of Force"}, text="Deputy Feldon: Show of Force (new in Forever)", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=25.6, y=59.9},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={3741}, names={"Hilary's Necklace"}, text="Shawn, a child standing at the lake by the bridge (24.2, 53.6)", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=24.2, y=53.6},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={125}, names={"The Lost Tools"}, text="Cross the bridge. Foreman Oslow stands at its north end.", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=27.1, y=48.6},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={118}, names={"The Price of Shoes"}, text="Verner Osgood, close to the bridge on the town side", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=25.9, y=47.3},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={120}, names={"Messenger to Stormwind"}, text="Magistrate Solomon in the town hall", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=24.9, y=44.5},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={127}, names={"Selling Fish"}, text="Dockmaster Baren on the dock in front of the town", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=22.6, y=47.4},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={129}, names={"A Free Lunch"}, text="Darcy, the waitress in the inn", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=21.5, y=44.3},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={65}, names={"The Defias Brotherhood"}, text="Wiley the Black, upstairs in the inn. Do not take his follow-up (The Defias Brotherhood, back to Westfall).", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=21.4, y=45.4},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={92}, names={"Redridge Goulash"}, text="Chef Breanna, in the house west of the inn", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=17.6, y=43.8},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={3741}, names={"Hilary's Necklace"}, text="Glinting Mud lies under water along the lake shore on both sides of the bridge (spots between 14 and 33, 51-56). Open the piles until one holds Hilary's Necklace.", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=25.2, y=54.2, path={{20.5,54.0}}},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={125}, names={"The Lost Tools"}, text="Swim east from the bridge. The Sunken Chest with Oslow's Toolbox lies on the lake bottom. Murlocs (17-20) swim around it: kill what comes at you before you dive (Voidwalker on it, DoTs, Drain Life), cast Unending Breath if you learned it in Stormwind, and keep the fish they drop (Spotted Sunfish for Selling Fish).", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=36.4, y=54.7},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={3741}, names={"Hilary's Necklace"}, text="Hilary, the girl next to Shawn", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=24.2, y=53.6},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={125}, names={"The Lost Tools"}, text="Foreman Oslow", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=27.1, y=48.6},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={89}, names={"The Everstill Bridge"}, text="Foreman Oslow", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=27.1, y=48.6},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={89}, names={"The Everstill Bridge"}, text="The data lists the gnolls north of Lakeshire as the source of Iron Pikes and Iron Rivets: Redridge Brutes (17-18) in the camps around 24, 35 and Redridge Mystics (18-19) a little further north. Take the path north out of town. Pull one camp member at a time and send the Voidwalker first. Kill the Mystics first: they cast and a warlock has no interrupt, so put Corruption, Curse of Agony and Immolate on the Mystic and wand it down. If two come, Fear the second only when no other camp is near (a feared gnoll brings friends), otherwise back off down the path. Do not go deeper than you need: Bashers (19-20) are behind them. Great Goretusks on the way drop snouts for the goulash.", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=24.0, y=34.8},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={246,98407}, names={"Assessing the Threat","Show of Force"}, text="Cross the bridge again and work the gnoll camps south and south-west of Lakeshire, toward Three Corners. Kill 10 Redridge Mongrels (15-16) and 6 Redridge Poachers (16-17, mostly in the southern camps around 29, 80), and every Redridge Thrasher (14-15) you see until you have 5 Spiked Collars. Send the Voidwalker first and let it hold the gnoll, then Corruption, Curse of Agony, Immolate and wand; Drain Life when you are hurt. Poachers shoot and do not come to you: send the Voidwalker to them. Gnolls run at low health and bring friends: with your DoTs on them they die on the way. Do not Fear inside a camp. Tarantulas (15-16) and Great Goretusks (16-17) live between the camps: kill them as you go for 5 Crisp Spider Meat and 5 Great Goretusk Snouts (Redridge Goulash).", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=20.0, y=70.0},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={129}, names={"A Free Lunch"}, text="Guard Parker at Three Corners", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=10.2, y=71.5},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={130}, names={"Visit the Herbalist"}, text="Guard Parker", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=10.2, y=71.5},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={127}, names={"Selling Fish"}, text="10 Spotted Sunfish from murlocs. Murloc Shorestrikers (16-17) on the south shore of the lake around 44, 69 are the easiest; Minor Tidecallers and Flesheaters (17-19) live further along the shore and in the water. This is a level 21 quest: pull single murlocs from the edge of a camp and send the Voidwalker first. Kill Tidecallers first (they heal and you cannot interrupt it: all three DoTs and Shadow Bolts until it is dead). Murlocs run and bring friends: keep Corruption and Curse of Agony on every one so a runner dies on the way, and never Fear on this shore. Health Funnel for the Voidwalker, a Healthstone for you. Keep every Murloc Fin you loot: Dockmaster Baren asks for 8 of them in the next segment. The condors for the goulash are next.", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=43.7, y=69.2},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={92}, names={"Redridge Goulash"}, text="Redridge Goulash: the 5 Tough Condor Meat come from Dire Condors (18-19), which fly over the hills south and east of the lake, close to the murloc shore. Send the Voidwalker and fight them one at a time with full health and mana; Drain Soul the last hit when you are short of Soul Shards (keep 3-5). If you still miss Crisp Spider Meat or Goretusk Snouts, Tarantulas and Great Goretusks are around Three Corners and all along the road back to Lakeshire.", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=47.7, y=56.9},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={246}, names={"Assessing the Threat"}, text="Deputy Feldon", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=25.6, y=60.0},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={98407}, names={"Show of Force"}, text="Deputy Feldon", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=25.6, y=59.9},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={89}, names={"The Everstill Bridge"}, text="Foreman Oslow, north end of the bridge", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=27.1, y=48.6},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={127}, names={"Selling Fish"}, text="Dockmaster Baren", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=22.6, y=47.4},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={130}, names={"Visit the Herbalist"}, text="Martie Jainrose, the herbalist on the west side of town", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=16.8, y=46.3},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={131}, names={"Delivering Daffodils"}, text="Martie Jainrose", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=16.8, y=46.3},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={92}, names={"Redridge Goulash"}, text="Chef Breanna", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=17.6, y=43.8},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={131}, names={"Delivering Daffodils"}, text="Darcy in the inn", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=21.5, y=44.3},
  {t="FLY", seg=6, arg="Stormwind", text="Ariena Stormfeather, south of the bridge"},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={120}, names={"Messenger to Stormwind"}, text="From the gryphon master walk through the Trade District to the Valley of Heroes, the bridge inside the main gate. General Marcus Jonathan sits on his horse there.", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=69.2, y=82.7},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={121}, names={"Messenger to Stormwind"}, text="General Marcus Jonathan. Keep it: you are back in Lakeshire in the next segment.", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=69.2, y=82.7},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={118}, names={"The Price of Shoes"}, text="Walk out of the gate and down the road to Goldshire (two minutes). Smith Argus works in the smithy.", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=41.7, y=65.5},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={119}, names={"Return to Verner"}, text="Smith Argus. Keep the Crate of Horseshoes for the next segment.", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=41.7, y=65.5},
  {t="N", seg=6, arg="Walk back into Stormwind and take the Deeprun Tram to Ironforge", text="The tram station is in the Dwarven District."},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=6, text="Briarthorn, the warlock trainer in the Forlorn Cavern in the north of the city: learn your level 18 spells (and the level 16 ones if you skipped the Slaughtered Lamb). Soulstone is the new one; take everything he offers. You come back here at 20.", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=50.4, y=5.7},
  {t="FLY", seg=6, arg="Thelsamar", text="Gryth Thurden, the gryphon master in the middle of Ironforge"},
  {t="S", seg=6, arg="Thelsamar", text="Innkeeper Hearthstove in the Stoutlager Inn. Buy food and water here."},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={436}, names={"Ironband's Excavation"}, text="Jern Hornhelm in Thelsamar (37.2, 47.4)", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=37.2, y=47.4},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={263}, names={"In Defense of the King's Lands"}, text="Follow the road south past the Valley of Kings tower and turn east into the Stonesplinter Valley. Kill what is still missing of 10 Stonesplinter Shamans and 10 Bonesnappers (15-16). The Shamans cast and a warlock has no interrupt: kill them first, Voidwalker on the Shaman, all three DoTs and the wand. If a Bonesnapper comes with it, Fear the Bonesnapper only where no other trogg stands near.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=33.0, y=80.0, path={{39.8,50.4},{39.8,53.4},{43.2,60.0},{43.2,63.6},{41.0,66.9},{41.0,70.2},{38.0,74.4},{34.8,74.4},{33.0,75.9}}},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={263}, names={"In Defense of the King's Lands"}, text="Mountaineer Wallbang in the southern guard tower", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=23.5, y=74.5},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={217}, names={"In Defense of the King's Lands"}, text="Captain Rugelfuss, in the same tower", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=23.2, y=73.7},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={86585}, names={"Banner of the Fallen"}, text="Back in the Stonesplinter Valley: the body of Mountaineer Ylva lies at 31.7, 86.4 (new in Forever)", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=31.7, y=86.4},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={86585}, names={"Banner of the Fallen"}, text="Use the Banner of Ironforge next to the body. The trogg Headsplitter comes for it: kill him. Clear the troggs around the spot first so nothing joins the fight, and have the Voidwalker at full health beside you: it takes him when he appears.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=32.2, y=86.4},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={217}, names={"In Defense of the King's Lands"}, text="Grawmug (17) and his guards Gnasher and Brawler (16) stand together in the cave at the very back of the valley (34.8, 90.5). Clear the cave on the way in. Three at once is a hard fight: put a Soulstone on yourself, have a Healthstone in your bags and start at full health and mana. Send the Voidwalker at Grawmug so it holds him, Fear one guard (the cave is clear, so it cannot bring anything) and kill the other with DoTs and Drain Life; then the second guard, Grawmug last. Health Funnel keeps the Voidwalker alive under Grawmug. If it goes badly run out of the cave and try again.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=34.7, y=90.6, path={{34.4,84.1}}, cave=true},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={217}, names={"In Defense of the King's Lands"}, text="Captain Rugelfuss", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=23.2, y=73.7},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={86585}, names={"Banner of the Fallen"}, text="Captain Rugelfuss", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=23.1, y=73.8},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={353}, names={"Stormpike's Delivery"}, text="Run the road north through Thelsamar to the northern guard tower. Mountaineer Stormpike is in the tower (24.8, 18.4).", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=24.8, y=18.4, path={{24.9,70.5},{24.9,66.3},{27.6,61.8},{27.6,57.6},{30.4,53.4},{30.0,43.3},{32.2,38.5},{29.8,22.6},{27.2,18.4}}},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={250}, names={"A Dark Threat Looms"}, text="Chief Engineer Hinderweir VII, in the middle of the Stonewrought Dam at the north end of the loch", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=46.0, y=13.6},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={250}, names={"A Dark Threat Looms"}, text="Walk east along the dam and down the eastern ramp. The Suspicious Barrel stands at 56.1, 13.2 with two Dark Iron Sappers (17) next to it: the Voidwalker holds one, Fear the other, and kill them one after the other.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=56.1, y=13.2},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={199}, names={"A Dark Threat Looms"}, text="From the Suspicious Barrel", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=56.1, y=13.2},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={199}, names={"A Dark Threat Looms"}, text="Back to Chief Engineer Hinderweir.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=46.0, y=13.6},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={161}, names={"A Dark Threat Looms"}, text="Chief Engineer Hinderweir: A Dark Threat Looms. The powder goes to Dun Modr in the north of the Wetlands. Do not go now: the route is there at level 30, keep it in your log until then", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=46.0, y=13.6},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={2039}, names={"Find Bingles"}, text="Go back down the eastern ramp and follow the east shore of the loch south. Bingles Blastenheimer stands by his broken flying machine. Stay on the shore: the Mo'grosh ogres in the hills north-east of the loch are elite.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=63.6, y=47.9, path={{43.2,14.5},{43.0,17.8},{47.4,20.8},{52.8,30.4},{59.2,31.3},{60.4,33.1},{65.2,33.1},{66.2,34.6},{66.2,41.5}}},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={2038}, names={"Bingles' Missing Supplies"}, text="Bingles Blastenheimer. You collect his tools after the lodge.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=63.6, y=47.9},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={385}, names={"Crocolisk Hunting"}, text="Keep south-east to the Farstrider Lodge. Marek Ironheart is inside.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=81.8, y=61.7},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={86758}, names={"Twisting the Knife"}, text="Marek Ironheart: Twisting the Knife (new in Forever)", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=81.8, y=61.6},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={257}, names={"A Hunter's Boast"}, text="Daryl the Youngling, in the lodge. This starts a 15 minute timer.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=83.5, y=65.5},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={257}, names={"A Hunter's Boast"}, text="Kill 6 Mountain Buzzards (15-16). They fly over the hills right outside the lodge, south and west of it.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=75.3, y=73.4, path={{79.3,66.0},{77.9,67.8},{77.9,71.1}}},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={257}, names={"A Hunter's Boast"}, text="Daryl the Youngling", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=83.5, y=65.5, path={{77.9,71.1},{77.9,67.8},{79.3,66.0}}},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={258}, names={"A Hunter's Challenge"}, text="Daryl the Youngling. A 12 minute timer: no detours.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=83.5, y=65.5},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={258}, names={"A Hunter's Challenge"}, text="Kill 5 Elder Mountain Boars (16-17). They roam north-west of the lodge, on the slopes toward Bingles (around 66, 40). Run straight there, kill five and run straight back.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=63.5, y=38.7},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={258}, names={"A Hunter's Challenge"}, text="Daryl the Youngling", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=83.5, y=65.5},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={385,86758}, names={"Crocolisk Hunting","Twisting the Knife"}, text="Go back to the east shore. Loch Crocolisks (14-15) lie along the shore and in the shallows from Bingles north: kill them for 5 Crocolisk Meat and 6 Crocolisk Skins. Daggerfang, the crocolisk for Marek's knife, hunts along the same shore (seen between 59 and 66, 34-55). Do not touch the Large Loch Crocolisk (22 elite).", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=61.9, y=44.7},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={2038}, names={"Bingles' Missing Supplies"}, text="Swim out to the islands in the north of the loch. Three toolbuckets hold the Wrench (48.7, 30.1), the Screwdriver (48.4, 20.5) and the Hammer (51.8, 24.1); the Blastencapper lies at 54.2, 26.6. Crocolisks swim between the islands.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=51.0, y=25.0, path={{62.8,43.6},{62.8,39.1},{60.4,33.4},{59.0,31.3},{52.8,30.4}}},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={2038}, names={"Bingles' Missing Supplies"}, text="Back to Bingles Blastenheimer on the east shore", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=63.6, y=47.9, path={{53.2,30.7},{59.2,31.3},{60.4,33.1},{65.2,33.1},{66.2,34.6},{66.2,41.5}}},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={385}, names={"Crocolisk Hunting"}, text="Marek Ironheart at the Farstrider Lodge", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=81.8, y=61.7},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={86758}, names={"Twisting the Knife"}, text="Marek Ironheart", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=81.8, y=61.6},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={436}, names={"Ironband's Excavation"}, text="The dig is south-west of the lodge. Magmar Fellhew stands in the camp above it.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=64.9, y=66.7},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={297}, names={"Gathering Idols"}, text="Magmar Fellhew", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=64.9, y=66.7},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={298}, names={"Excavation Progress Report"}, text="Prospector Ironband, next to him. Just a letter for Thelsamar.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=65.9, y=65.6},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={86613}, names={"Excavation Tools"}, text="Excavation Tools (new in Forever). The quest starts from the Excavation Tools you pick up inside the dig; the data has no exact spots. Look for tool sets on the ground while you kill troggs, and pick up six. If you find none, press Skip here and on its hand-in.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=70.2, y=64.5},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={297,86613}, names={"Gathering Idols","Excavation Tools"}, text="Go down into the dig. Stonesplinter Geomancers (17-18), Diggers (18-19) and Berserk Troggs (19-20) drop the 8 Carved Stone Idols. Pull from the edge, one trogg at a time, Voidwalker first, and kill Geomancers first: they cast fire spells and a warlock has no interrupt, so put all three DoTs on the Geomancer and Drain Life the damage back. No Fear down here: the dig is packed. Collect the six tool sets while you are down there.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=70.2, y=64.5},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={297}, names={"Gathering Idols"}, text="Magmar Fellhew", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=64.9, y=66.7},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={86613}, names={"Excavation Tools"}, text="Prospector Ironband", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=65.9, y=65.6},
  {t="L", seg=6, lvl=20, text="Only if you are not close to 20 yet (the step ticks by itself at 20). The Ironforge trip that comes next is your level 20 training stop with Briarthorn. The two hand-ins on the way back to Thelsamar give about 3,000 XP with the kills on the way: if your level 19 bar reads less than about 18,200 / 21,300, kill troggs in the dig (17-20) until it does, then press Skip. Expect to need 25 to 30 kills.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=70.2, y=64.5},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={86614}, names={"Silver of the Waves"}, text="Walk west along the south end of the loch and up its west shore. The Discarded Fishing Toolbox lies on the shore at 48.8, 54.0 (new in Forever).", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=48.8, y=54.0},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={86614}, names={"Silver of the Waves"}, text="Khara Deepwater, the fishing trainer on the shore north-east of Thelsamar (40.4, 39.4)", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=40.4, y=39.4},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={298}, names={"Excavation Progress Report"}, text="Jern Hornhelm in Thelsamar", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=37.2, y=47.4},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={301}, names={"Report to Ironforge"}, text="Jern Hornhelm", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=37.2, y=47.4},
  {t="FLY", seg=6, arg="Ironforge", text="Thorgrum Borrelson in Thelsamar. You should be level 20 now."},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={301}, names={"Report to Ironforge"}, text="Prospector Stormpike in the Hall of Explorers", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=74.6, y=11.7},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={302}, names={"Powder to Ironband"}, text="Prospector Stormpike", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=74.6, y=11.7},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=6, text="Briarthorn, the warlock trainer in the Forlorn Cavern in the north of the city: learn your level 20 spells, everything he offers. Buy the Voidwalker's new spell books from the demon trainer beside him", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=50.4, y=5.7},
  {t="N", seg=6, arg="Optional, not in this route: the Succubus. At level 20 Gakin the Darkbinder, in the cellar of the Slaughtered Lamb in Stormwind, gives Devourer of Souls (1716). It sends you to Takar the Seer in the southern Barrens, then for Heartswood, and ends with The Binding in the cellar. That is two continents, so the guide does not route it and nothing later needs it: the Voidwalker stays your leveling pet. Do it whenever it suits you; the logger records what you take."},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={2041}, names={"Speak with Shoni"}, text="Gnoarn the gnome (ForeverChanges shows him at 62.2, 29.2; Questie has him in Tinker Town at 69.2, 50.6). A letter for Stormwind, handed in in the next segment.", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=62.2, y=29.2},
  {t="FLY", seg=6, arg="Thelsamar", text="Gryth Thurden"},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={302}, names={"Powder to Ironband"}, text="Jern Hornhelm", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=37.2, y=47.4},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={273}, names={"Resupplying the Excavation"}, text="Jern Hornhelm", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=37.2, y=47.4},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={468}, names={"Report to Mountaineer Rockgar"}, text="Mountaineer Kadrell walks the road through Thelsamar (needs level 19)", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=34.2, y=47.8},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={273}, names={"Resupplying the Excavation"}, text="Huldar waits on the road south of the loch (52.2, 69.3), on the way to the dig", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=52.2, y=69.3},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={454}, names={"After the Ambush"}, text="Huldar", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=52.2, y=69.3},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={454}, names={"After the Ambush"}, text="Miran, next to him", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=52.2, y=69.4},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={309}, names={"Protecting the Shipment"}, text="Miran. This starts an escort to the excavation site.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=52.2, y=69.4},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={309}, names={"Protecting the Shipment"}, text="Walk with Miran. Dark Iron dwarves ambush the cart on the way: stay close to Miran with the Voidwalker beside you. The Voidwalker holds the attackers: send it at each dwarf as it appears, put your DoTs on it and kill them one at a time; Fear a second one, nothing else is near on this road. You cannot heal Miran. Miran must survive.", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=52.2, y=69.4},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={309}, names={"Protecting the Shipment"}, text="Prospector Ironband at the excavation camp", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=65.9, y=65.6, path={{52.2,66.0},{55.0,62.1},{56.6,62.1},{58.4,64.2}}},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={468}, names={"Report to Mountaineer Rockgar"}, text="Walk back around the south end of the loch, through Thelsamar and up the road north. Mountaineer Rockgar guards the Dun Algaz tunnel in the north-west corner of Loch Modan (25.4, 10.4)", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=25.4, y=10.4, path={{58.4,64.2},{56.6,62.1},{50.8,62.4},{45.4,53.4},{42.8,46.9},{44.0,39.4},{41.8,36.1},{33.8,36.1},{32.0,33.4},{29.8,25.9},{29.8,22.3},{27.6,17.8},{27.0,12.1}}},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={455}, names={"The Algaz Gauntlet"}, text="Mountaineer Rockgar", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=25.4, y=10.4},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={455}, names={"The Algaz Gauntlet"}, text="Go into the Dun Algaz tunnels behind Rockgar. Dragonmaw Scouts (19-20) and Grunts (20-21) stand along the road and in the side camps: kill 8 Scouts and 6 Grunts. They hit hard for your level: Soulstone on yourself, Voidwalker first, one at a time, at full health and mana; Corruption, Curse of Agony, Immolate, then Drain Life; Health Funnel for the Voidwalker, eat and drink between pulls. They run at low health: your DoTs finish a runner. Do not Fear in the camps. You do not have to walk through to the Wetlands now. Whatever is missing you can finish in segment 08: press Skip then.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=48.6, y=77.0},
  {t="H", seg=6, arg="Thelsamar", text="Hearthstone back to the inn"},
  {t="FLY", seg=7, arg="Ironforge", text="Thorgrum Borrelson in Thelsamar"},
  {t="N", seg=7, arg="Look for a Bronze Tube in Ironforge", text="Viktori in Darkshire needs one Bronze Tube for Look to the Stars. Engineers make it: check the auction house, and ask Gearcutter Cogspinner, the engineering supplier in Tinker Town (67.8, 42.5), on your way to the tram. Not verified: the quest data only lists drops from machines and a vendor in Thousand Needles, so a city supplier stocking one is Classic knowledge. Without a tube you skip the Look to the Stars steps later."},
  {t="N", seg=7, arg="Take the Deeprun Tram to Stormwind", text="The tram station is in Tinker Town."},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={2041}, names={"Speak with Shoni"}, text="Shoni the Shilent, in the Dwarven District a few steps from the tram exit. Do not take her follow-up (Deadmines). Billibub Cogspinner, the engineering supplier, stands close by (62.4, 29.9): ask him for a Bronze Tube too, and try the Stormwind auction house.", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=62.6, y=34.1},
  {t="FLY", seg=7, arg="Lakeshire", text="Dungar Longdrink, the gryphon master in the Trade District"},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={119}, names={"Return to Verner"}, text="Cross the bridge. Verner Osgood, on the town side.", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=25.9, y=47.3},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={122,124}, names={"Underbelly Scales","A Baying of Gnolls"}, text="Verner Osgood", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=25.9, y=47.3},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={98386}, names={"Alther's Mill"}, text="Foreman Oslow at the north end of the bridge: Alther's Mill (new in Forever)", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=27.1, y=48.5},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={20}, names={"Blackrock Menace"}, text="Marshal Marris, a few steps east of the bridge", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=28.4, y=49.0},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={98387}, names={"Blackrock Blockade"}, text="Marshal Marris: Blackrock Blockade (new in Forever)", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=28.3, y=48.8},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={121}, names={"Messenger to Stormwind"}, text="Magistrate Solomon in the town hall", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=24.9, y=44.5, path={{28.2,46.9},{26.4,44.2}}},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={91}, names={"Solomon's Law"}, text="Bailiff Conacher, in the town hall too", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=24.6, y=44.3},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={150}, names={"Murloc Poachers"}, text="Dockmaster Baren on the dock (needs level 20)", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=22.6, y=47.4},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={34}, names={"An Unwelcome Guest"}, text="Martie Jainrose, the herbalist on the west side of town. Bellygrub is level 24: you kill him last, after the big loop.", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=16.8, y=46.3},
  {t="C", seg=7, q={124}, names={"A Baying of Gnolls"}, text="Take the path north out of Lakeshire. Kill 10 Redridge Brutes (17-18, the first camps around 24, 35) and 8 Redridge Mystics (18-19, further up around 24, 29). Send the Voidwalker first. Mystics cast and a warlock has no interrupt: kill them first with Corruption, Curse of Agony, Immolate and Shadow Bolts. Gnolls run at low health: your DoTs finish them. Fear a second gnoll only at the edge of a camp, never inside one. Do not chase Yowler deeper in the hills: that quest is for a later segment.", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=24.1, y=32.0, path={{15.7,46.3},{14.1,42.1},{19.1,35.5},{23.3,35.2}}},
  {t="C", seg=7, q={98386}, names={"Alther's Mill"}, text="Go back down and follow the north shore of the lake east to Alther's Mill. Kill 12 Greater Tarantulas (19-20) and destroy 6 Tarantula Eggs around the mill. Send the Voidwalker first and let it take the bites. They poison and a warlock cannot cure it: Drain Life, bandage and eat between fights. Leave Chatter, the rare elite spider that walks here, alone.", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=50.4, y=41.1, path={{24.3,37.9},{30.0,44.8},{39.6,39.4},{40.6,36.1},{42.2,36.1},{44.2,39.1}}},
  {t="C", seg=7, q={91}, names={"Solomon's Law"}, text="Keep east into Galardell Valley. Shadowhide gnolls drop the 10 Shadowhide Pendants. Stay at the mouth of the valley, where Rabid Shadowhide Gnolls (21-22) and Shadowhide Gnolls (22-23) stand around 69, 50; the Brutes, Warriors, Slayers and Darkweavers deeper in are 23-26. They are above your level, so some of your spells will be resisted: put a Soulstone on yourself, pull one at a time from far away with the Voidwalker and give it a moment before you start with Corruption, Curse of Agony and Immolate; then Drain Life. Health Funnel keeps the Voidwalker up. If a second gnoll comes, Fear it only when it would run toward the valley mouth, not deeper in; otherwise back off toward the valley mouth. Eat and drink to full before each pull.", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=69.0, y=50.2},
  {t="C", seg=7, q={20,98387}, names={"Blackrock Menace","Blackrock Blockade"}, text="From the mouth of the valley go south. Blackrock Grunts (19-20) and Outrunners (20-21) camp on the slopes south-east of the lake, below Stonewatch Keep; Renegades (21-22) are mixed in. They drop the 10 Battleworn Axes. The 8 Stolen Weapons and 10 Blackrock Supplies are in the same camps (new quest: the giver says \"south-east below Stonewatch Keep\" and the data has no exact spots, so look for things to click in the camps and loot every orc). Stay out of Stonewatch Keep itself: the Scouts, Sentries and Shadowcasters there are elite. Voidwalker first, one orc at a time, all three DoTs, Drain Life when you are hurt. Orcs run for help at low health: your DoTs finish a runner, add a Shadow Bolt. Do not Fear inside a camp.", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=58.0, y=62.0},
  {t="C", seg=7, q={150}, names={"Murloc Poachers"}, text="Follow the lake shore back west. Murlocs along the south-east shore (Flesheaters, Tidecallers, Scouts, 18-20) drop the Murloc Fins: you need 8, counting the ones you already carry. As before: single murlocs from the edge of a camp, Voidwalker first, Tidecallers first (they heal and you cannot interrupt), DoTs on every murloc so a runner dies on the way, no Fear on the shore.", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=47.3, y=60.9},
  {t="C", seg=7, q={122}, names={"Underbelly Scales"}, text="Black Dragon Whelps (17-18) fly over the hills south of the lake, between the murloc shore and Lakeshire. Kill them until you have 6 Underbelly Whelp Scales. They cast fireballs and you cannot interrupt them: send the Voidwalker so they throw them at it, Health Funnel it, DoT the whelp and wand it down. Drain Soul the last hit when you are short of Soul Shards (keep 3-5), and eat and drink between fights.", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=38.6, y=67.4},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={20}, names={"Blackrock Menace"}, text="Back in Lakeshire: Marshal Marris. Do not take the follow-up, Tharil'zun (elite).", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=28.4, y=49.0},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={98387}, names={"Blackrock Blockade"}, text="Marshal Marris", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=28.3, y=48.8},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={98386}, names={"Alther's Mill"}, text="Foreman Oslow", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=27.1, y=48.6},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={122,124}, names={"Underbelly Scales","A Baying of Gnolls"}, text="Verner Osgood. Do not take Howling in the Hills yet.", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=25.9, y=47.3},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={150}, names={"Murloc Poachers"}, text="Dockmaster Baren", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=22.6, y=47.4},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={91}, names={"Solomon's Law"}, text="Bailiff Conacher in the town hall", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=24.6, y=44.3},
  {t="C", seg=7, q={34}, names={"An Unwelcome Guest"}, text="Bellygrub (24), a big boar, roots around in the fields west of Lakeshire, past Martie's garden (10.6, 49.3). He is four levels above you and hits hard: put a Soulstone on yourself, carry a Healthstone and start at full health and mana. Send the Voidwalker and let it hold him for a few seconds, then Corruption, Curse of Agony and Immolate (recast what he resists) and wand or Drain Life; keep Health Funnel on the Voidwalker. If he turns on you, use Sacrifice for the shield and Fear him: the fields around him are empty. If he gets you low, run back toward the town guards.", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=10.6, y=49.3},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={34}, names={"An Unwelcome Guest"}, text="Martie Jainrose", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=16.8, y=46.3},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={386}, names={"What Comes Around..."}, text="Guard Berton in Lakeshire. The head of Targorr the Dread.", zone="Redridge Mountains", map=1433, x=26.3, y=46.6, dg=3},
  {t="F", seg=7, arg="Darkshire", text="Take the road south-west to Three Corners and from there the road south into Duskwood. It leads straight to Darkshire. Stay on the road and keep running: the wolves and spiders beside it are above your level. Felicia Maline, the gryphon master, stands on the east side of town.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=77.5, y=44.3},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={163,164,165}, names={"Raven Hill","Deliveries to Sven","The Hermit"}, text="Elaine Carevin, at the south end of town", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=75.3, y=48.7},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={56}, names={"The Night Watch"}, text="Commander Althea Ebonlocke, in front of the town hall", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=73.5, y=46.8},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={96139}, names={"The Valor Family"}, text="Sirra Von'Indi in the town hall: The Valor Family (new in Forever)", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=72.6, y=47.5},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={101}, names={"The Totem of Infliction"}, text="Madame Eva, in the house on the north side of the square. You collect her parts over the whole Duskwood trip.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=75.8, y=45.3},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={174}, names={"Look To The Stars"}, text="Viktori Prism'Antras, in the house at the east end of town. Only with a Bronze Tube in your bags. Without one press Skip here and on every Look to the Stars step that follows in this segment.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=79.8, y=48.0},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={174}, names={"Look To The Stars"}, text="Viktori Prism'Antras: hand over the Bronze Tube", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=79.8, y=48.0},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={175}, names={"Look To The Stars"}, text="Viktori Prism'Antras", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=79.8, y=48.0},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={175}, names={"Look To The Stars"}, text="Blind Mary lives in the lone house south of Darkshire (82.0, 59.1)", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=82.0, y=59.1},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={177}, names={"Look To The Stars"}, text="Blind Mary. The Insane Ghoul is level 26: you fight him at the end of the segment, when you are back at her house.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=82.0, y=59.1},
  {t="C", seg=7, q={56}, names={"The Night Watch"}, text="Tranquil Gardens Cemetery is just south of Mary's house. Kill 8 Skeletal Warriors (21-22) and 6 Skeletal Mages (22-23). Send the Voidwalker first. Mages cast and a warlock has no interrupt: kill them first, all three DoTs and Shadow Bolts; the Voidwalker holds a Warrior meanwhile. Fear a second skeleton only at the edge of the cemetery. Loot everything: they drop Skeleton Fingers for Madame Eva (you need 10). Keep away from the chapel for now, the Insane Ghoul is inside.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=79.4, y=70.8},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={245}, names={"Eight-Legged Menaces"}, text="Take the road west along the south side of Duskwood. Watcher Dodds stands on it, about halfway (45.1, 67.0). From here on kill the spiders you pass: Pygmy Venom Web Spiders (18-19) count for him, and every spider can drop Vials of Spider Venom for Madame Eva (5) and Gooey Spider Legs. Keep 6 Gooey Spider Legs for a later quest. Let the Voidwalker take the bites: a warlock cannot cure their poison, so Drain Life, bandage and eat. You hand this in when you pass Dodds again.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=45.1, y=67.0, path={{69.8,70.2},{67.0,64.8},{65.2,63.6},{64.4,58.2},{50.6,60.0},{49.2,61.8},{45.6,62.7}}},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={163}, names={"Raven Hill"}, text="Jitters hides in Raven Hill, the dead village in the west (18.4, 56.4)", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=18.4, y=56.4, path={{45.0,63.3},{43.6,61.2},{36.8,59.4},{32.4,53.4},{25.0,52.8},{22.7,56.4}}},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={5}, names={"Jitters' Growling Gut"}, text="Jitters", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=18.4, y=56.4},
  {t="C", seg=7, q={96139}, names={"The Valor Family"}, text="Search Raven Hill for the Raven Hill Tome. New quest: the data has no exact spot, only \"search Raven Hill\". Look inside the ruined houses and around the village for a book you can click.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=18.4, y=56.4},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={164}, names={"Deliveries to Sven"}, text="Sven Yorgen camps on the western edge of Duskwood, north-west of Raven Hill (7.8, 34.1)", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=7.8, y=34.1, path={{15.7,55.2},{10.5,48.7},{9.3,40.9},{7.3,37.6}}},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={95}, names={"Sven's Revenge"}, text="Sven Yorgen", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=7.8, y=34.1},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={226}, names={"Wolves at Our Heels"}, text="Lars, at the same camp", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=7.7, y=33.2},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={95}, names={"Sven's Revenge"}, text="Sven's farm is in the south of the zone, south of Watcher Dodds. Go back along the south road and click the Mound of loose dirt behind the tree stump at the farm (49.9, 77.7). Zzarc'Vul's ogres (around 37, 81, west of the farm) are far above your level: keep away from their mound.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=49.9, y=77.7, path={{8.3,31.3},{13.1,29.8},{16.3,26.8},{28.4,30.1},{32.2,35.8},{32.2,50.4},{32.6,53.4},{34.8,57.0},{36.8,59.4},{40.0,60.6},{46.8,61.8},{52.8,60.9},{53.6,62.1},{53.6,66.0},{51.4,69.3},{52.4,74.4}}},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={230}, names={"Sven's Camp"}, text="From the mound", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=49.9, y=77.7},
  {t="C", seg=7, q={245}, names={"Eight-Legged Menaces"}, text="Finish the 15 Pygmy Venom Web Spiders (18-19) in the woods around the farm and along the south road.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=10.4, y=55.5, path={{52.4,74.4},{51.4,69.3},{53.6,66.0},{52.8,60.9},{46.8,61.8},{37.4,59.7},{32.4,53.4},{25.8,52.8},{24.3,50.4},{11.5,50.7},{10.5,52.2}}},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={245}, names={"Eight-Legged Menaces"}, text="Watcher Dodds, back on the road north-west of the farm", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=45.1, y=67.0, path={{10.5,52.2},{11.5,50.7},{24.3,50.4},{25.8,52.8},{32.4,53.4},{36.8,59.4},{43.6,61.2},{45.0,63.3}}},
  {t="C", seg=7, q={226}, names={"Wolves at Our Heels"}, text="Cut north-west through the woods toward the north side of Raven Hill Cemetery. Kill 12 Starving Dire Wolves (19-20) and 8 Rabid Dire Wolves (20-21): both roam the northern half of western Duskwood.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=30.0, y=28.0, path={{45.0,63.3},{43.6,61.2},{36.8,59.4},{32.6,53.4},{32.4,31.6}}},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={165}, names={"The Hermit"}, text="Abercrombie the hermit lives in the shack north of Raven Hill Cemetery (28.1, 31.5)", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=28.1, y=31.5},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={148}, names={"Supplies from Darkshire"}, text="Abercrombie", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=28.1, y=31.5},
  {t="C", seg=7, q={101}, names={"The Totem of Infliction"}, text="Finish Madame Eva's list. The 10 Ghoul Fangs drop from the ghouls at the east edge of Raven Hill Cemetery, south-west of the shack: Flesh Eaters (24-25) and Rotted Ones (25-26). They are well above you: put a Soulstone on yourself, pull single ghouls out to the edge with the Voidwalker, give it a moment, then DoT (recast what is resisted) and Drain Life; Health Funnel for the Voidwalker. Fight at full health and mana, eat and drink after every pull, and do not go deeper in, where Plague Spreaders and Brain Eaters (27-29) wait. No Fear here: a feared ghoul runs into the cemetery and comes back with more. They spread disease and a warlock cannot cure it: bandage, Drain Life, eat. Skeleton Fingers also drop from Skeletal Horrors (23-24) around Raven Hill, the venom from any spider. If the fangs are too hard at your level, leave the list open: the route is back here in segment 11.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=23.8, y=37.1},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={230}, names={"Sven's Camp"}, text="Back to Sven Yorgen at his camp", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=7.8, y=34.1},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={262}, names={"The Shadowy Figure"}, text="Sven Yorgen", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=7.8, y=34.1},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={226}, names={"Wolves at Our Heels"}, text="Lars", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=7.7, y=33.2},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={96139}, names={"The Valor Family"}, text="Follow the road east across the whole zone to Darkshire. Sirra Von'Indi in the town hall.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=72.6, y=47.5, path={{8.3,31.3},{13.1,29.8},{16.3,26.8},{28.4,30.1},{32.2,35.8},{32.6,53.4},{36.8,59.4},{40.0,60.6},{49.4,60.9},{63.0,58.8},{64.0,55.5},{68.0,49.9},{68.8,45.7}}},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={56}, names={"The Night Watch"}, text="Commander Althea Ebonlocke", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=73.5, y=46.8},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={57}, names={"The Night Watch"}, text="Commander Althea Ebonlocke. Level 24-25 skeletons at Raven Hill: kept for segment 11.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=73.5, y=46.8},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={148,262}, names={"Supplies from Darkshire","The Shadowy Figure"}, text="Madame Eva", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=75.8, y=45.3},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={149,265}, names={"Ghost Hair Thread","The Shadowy Search Continues"}, text="Madame Eva", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=75.8, y=45.3},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={101}, names={"The Totem of Infliction"}, text="Madame Eva, if you have 10 fangs, 10 fingers and 5 venom vials. If not, press Skip and hand it in on the next Duskwood trip.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=75.8, y=45.3},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={5}, names={"Jitters' Growling Gut"}, text="Chef Grual in the tavern", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=73.8, y=43.5},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={93}, names={"Dusky Crab Cakes"}, text="Chef Grual", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=73.8, y=43.5},
  {t="C", seg=7, q={93}, names={"Dusky Crab Cakes"}, text="6 Gooey Spider Legs. You should have them from the spiders on the south road; if not, more spiders sit beside the road west of town.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=30.4, y=50.2, path={{71.8,46.6},{68.8,45.7},{68.0,49.9},{64.0,55.5},{63.8,57.6},{59.4,59.7},{50.6,60.0},{49.2,61.2},{40.0,60.6},{36.8,59.4}}},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={93}, names={"Dusky Crab Cakes"}, text="Chef Grual", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=73.8, y=43.5, path={{36.8,59.4},{40.0,60.6},{49.2,61.2},{50.6,60.0},{59.4,59.7},{63.0,58.8},{64.0,55.5},{68.0,49.9},{68.8,45.7},{71.8,46.6}}},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={240}, names={"Return to Jitters"}, text="Chef Grual. The crab cakes go back to Jitters in segment 11.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=73.8, y=43.5},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={265}, names={"The Shadowy Search Continues"}, text="Clerk Daltry in the town hall", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=72.5, y=46.9},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={266}, names={"Inquire at the Inn"}, text="Clerk Daltry", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=72.5, y=46.9},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={266}, names={"Inquire at the Inn"}, text="Tavernkeep Smitts in the tavern", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=73.8, y=44.5},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={453}, names={"Finding the Shadowy Figure"}, text="Tavernkeep Smitts. Keep it for segment 11.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=73.8, y=44.5},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={149}, names={"Ghost Hair Thread"}, text="Blind Mary, in the house south of town", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=82.0, y=59.1},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={154}, names={"Return the Comb"}, text="Blind Mary", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=82.0, y=59.1},
  {t="C", seg=7, q={177}, names={"Look To The Stars"}, text="Press Skip if you never had a Bronze Tube. The Insane Ghoul (26) stands in the chapel of Tranquil Gardens Cemetery (80.9, 72.0). Kill the skeletons near the chapel first so the fight stays one on one. He is four levels above you, so your spells will often be resisted: put a Soulstone on yourself, carry a Healthstone and start at full health and mana. Send the Voidwalker in and let it hold him for a few seconds, then Corruption, Curse of Agony and Immolate, recasting what he resists, and Drain Life or the wand; keep Health Funnel on the Voidwalker. If he turns on you, use Sacrifice for the shield; do not count on Fear at this level gap. Walk away and come back later if it goes badly. He drops Mary's Looking Glass.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=80.9, y=72.0},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={154}, names={"Return the Comb"}, text="Back in Darkshire: Madame Eva", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=75.8, y=45.3},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={157}, names={"Deliver the Thread"}, text="Madame Eva. The thread goes to Abercrombie in segment 11.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=75.8, y=45.3},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={177}, names={"Look To The Stars"}, text="Viktori Prism'Antras", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=79.8, y=48.0},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={181}, names={"Look To The Stars"}, text="Viktori Prism'Antras. The ogre Zzarc'Vul is level 33: kept for segment 11.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=79.8, y=48.0},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={66}, names={"The Legend of Stalvan"}, text="Madame Eva: The Legend of Stalvan (needs level 22)", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=75.8, y=45.3},
  {t="T", seg=7, q={66}, names={"The Legend of Stalvan"}, text="Clerk Daltry in the town hall", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=72.5, y=46.9},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={67}, names={"The Legend of Stalvan"}, text="Clerk Daltry. It sends you to Moonbrook in Westfall: kept for segment 11.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=72.5, y=46.9},
  {t="A", seg=7, q={377}, names={"Crime and Punishment"}, text="Councilman Millstipe in Darkshire. The hand of Dextren Ward.", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=71.9, y=47.8, dg=3},
  {t="H", seg=7, arg="Thelsamar", text="Hearthstone to Thelsamar. Next stop: the Wetlands."},
  {t="C", seg=8, q={455}, names={"The Algaz Gauntlet"}, text="From Thelsamar run the road north, past the northern guard tower and Mountaineer Rockgar, into the Dun Algaz tunnels. Finish what is still missing of 8 Dragonmaw Scouts (19-20) and 6 Dragonmaw Grunts (20-21) along the road and in the camps beside it, and walk the road all the way through to the Wetlands side.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=48.6, y=77.0},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={276}, names={"Tramping Paws"}, text="Stay on the road where it leaves the hills and follow it north to the Green Belt. Rethiel the Greenwarden stands in the trees east of the road (56.4, 40.4).", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=56.4, y=40.4, path={{57.0,65.1},{56.8,58.8},{58.6,56.1},{58.6,51.0},{60.0,49.9},{60.4,44.5},{57.0,43.3},{56.0,41.8}}},
  {t="C", seg=8, q={276}, names={"Tramping Paws"}, text="His gnolls live where you came out of the hills: Mosshide Gnolls (20-21) and Mosshide Mongrels (21-22) fill the marsh in the south-east, from the Dun Algaz road east to the waterfalls under the southern cliffs (54-67, 56-76). Go back south and kill 15 Gnolls and 10 Mongrels. They stand in small groups: send the Voidwalker at one from as far away as you can, let it hold the gnoll away from the others, then Corruption, Curse of Agony, Immolate and wand. If a second one comes, the Voidwalker holds both, or Fear it, but only where it cannot run into another group: a feared gnoll brings friends. Gnolls run at low health and a warlock cannot slow them: keep your curses on and finish a runner with Shadow Bolt. Drain Life and Health Funnel keep you both up. Back off if a third one joins.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=61.0, y=68.0, path={{56.0,41.8},{57.0,43.3},{59.6,43.3},{66.4,50.4},{65.0,63.9},{64.0,65.4},{60.8,66.0}}},
  {t="T", seg=8, q={276}, names={"Tramping Paws"}, text="Rethiel the Greenwarden", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=56.4, y=40.4, path={{60.8,66.0},{64.0,65.4},{65.0,63.9},{66.4,50.4},{59.6,43.3},{57.0,43.3},{56.0,41.8}}},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={277}, names={"Fire Taboo"}, text="Rethiel the Greenwarden", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=56.4, y=40.4},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={469}, names={"Daily Delivery"}, text="Einar Stonegrip, the crocolisk hunter camped a little west of Rethiel, by the road (49.9, 39.4)", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=49.9, y=39.4},
  {t="C", seg=8, q={277}, names={"Fire Taboo"}, text="9 Crude Flints. Mosshide Fenrunners (22-23) carry them: they roam all around the Green Belt, on both sides of the road here. Mistweavers (22-23) drop them too: they are casters and a warlock has no interrupt, so kill them first, or Fear one while you finish another enemy. Black Oozes crawl around in the same marsh; they matter later, not now.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=51.0, y=40.0},
  {t="T", seg=8, q={277}, names={"Fire Taboo"}, text="Rethiel the Greenwarden", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=56.4, y=40.4},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={275}, names={"Blisters on The Land"}, text="Rethiel the Greenwarden. Fen Creepers are level 24-25 and hide in the waterways further north and west: kill the ones you happen to meet, and keep the quest for segment 10.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=56.4, y=40.4},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={294}, names={"Ormer's Revenge"}, text="Follow the road west, then leave it to the south for Whelgar's Excavation Site. Ormer Ironbraid stands at its entrance (38.2, 50.9). Needs level 22. Do not go down into the dig: the raptors there are 25-27.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=38.2, y=50.9},
  {t="C", seg=8, q={294}, names={"Ormer's Revenge"}, text="The raptors he wants live west of the dig, on both sides of the road to Menethil Harbor: kill 10 Mottled Raptors (22-23) and 10 Mottled Screechers (24-25). Screechers call for help, so let the Voidwalker hold them away from other raptors and kill them fast: Corruption, Curse of Agony, Immolate, then Shadow Bolt. You hand this in when the big loop brings you back to Ormer.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=25.5, y=49.5},
  {t="F", seg=8, arg="Menethil Harbor", text="Keep west on the road to its end and cross the bridge into Menethil Harbor. Shellei Brondir, the gryphon master, stands by the docks.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=9.5, y=59.7},
  {t="S", seg=8, arg="Menethil Harbor", text="Innkeeper Helbrek in the Deepwater Tavern", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=10.7, y=61.0},
  {t="T", seg=8, q={455}, names={"The Algaz Gauntlet"}, text="Valstag Ironjaw, outside the keep in the middle of town", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=10.1, y=56.9},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={98197}, names={"Spoils of War"}, text="Valstag Ironjaw: Spoils of War (new in Forever)", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=10.2, y=56.8},
  {t="C", seg=8, q={98197}, names={"Spoils of War"}, text="Recover 6 Khaz Modan Timber and 30 Khaz Modan Iron from Menethil Harbor. The quest says they lie under water in the harbor; the data has no exact spots. Cast Unending Breath on yourself, dive around the docks and piers and look for timber and iron you can click. Renew Unending Breath when it runs out.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=10.1, y=56.9},
  {t="T", seg=8, q={98197}, names={"Spoils of War"}, text="Valstag Ironjaw", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=10.0, y=56.8},
  {t="T", seg=8, q={469}, names={"Daily Delivery"}, text="James Halloran, the tanner on the north-west side of town", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=8.5, y=55.7},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={484}, names={"Young Crocolisk Skins"}, text="James Halloran", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=8.6, y=55.7},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={279}, names={"Claws from the Deep"}, text="Karl Boran, by the docks", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=8.3, y=58.6},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={98282}, names={"Alchemical Hazards"}, text="Caitlin Grassman: Alchemical Hazards (new in Forever)", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=11.9, y=58.8},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={470}, names={"Digging Through the Ooze"}, text="Sida, next to her", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=11.8, y=58.0},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={305}, names={"In Search of The Excavation Team"}, text="Tarrel Rockweaver, on the north side of town (needs level 21)", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=11.5, y=52.2},
  {t="C", seg=8, q={279}, names={"Claws from the Deep"}, text="Leave by the bridge and go north along the coast. The Bluegill camp is at the river mouth (15.5, 40.1): kill 12 Bluegill Murlocs (20-21). Gobbler (22) walks at the east end of the camp (18.1, 39.8): loot his head. Other Bluegill types do not count for the 12 but come along if you pull carelessly: send the Voidwalker at one at a time and fight at the edge of the camp. Do not Fear inside the camp: a feared murloc brings the rest. Murlocs run at low health: keep Corruption and Curse of Agony on them and finish a runner with Shadow Bolt.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=15.5, y=40.1},
  {t="C", seg=8, q={484}, names={"Young Crocolisk Skins"}, text="Follow the river east. Young Wetlands Crocolisks (21-22) lie on its banks and in every waterway of the marsh: 4 skins. Leave the Wetlands Crocolisks (23-24) and Giant ones alone unless they come for you.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=30.0, y=40.0},
  {t="C", seg=8, q={470}, names={"Digging Through the Ooze"}, text="Sida's Bag is inside an ooze. Kill every Black Ooze (23-24) you pass while you cross the marsh: they can carry it. If you still have no bag, go to Ironbeard's Tomb in the north (44.4, 24.8), where the Crimson Oozes (24-25) sit close together, and kill oozes there until it drops. Oozes hit slowly and are easy fights one at a time for the Voidwalker; use Drain Soul for the last hit on a few of them if you are short of Soul Shards (keep 3-5).", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=44.4, y=24.8},
  {t="C", seg=8, q={98282}, names={"Alchemical Hazards"}, text="Cross to the south-east. Thelgen Rock is the spider cave in the cliffs south of the Green Belt (around 50, 62). Kill Leech Stalkers and Cave Stalkers (21-22) inside and in front of the cave until one drops an Unruptured Stalker Gland. They poison you and a warlock cannot cure poison: let the Voidwalker take the bites, use Drain Life in the fight, and bandage and eat between fights. Leave the Leech Widow (24 elite) deeper inside alone.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=50.3, y=61.9, path={{52.9,62.9}}, cave=true},
  {t="T", seg=8, q={305}, names={"In Search of The Excavation Team"}, text="Back north-west to Whelgar's Excavation Site. Merrin Rockweaver stands near Ormer at the entrance (38.9, 52.3).", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=38.9, y=52.3},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={306}, names={"In Search of The Excavation Team"}, text="Merrin Rockweaver", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=38.9, y=52.3},
  {t="T", seg=8, q={294}, names={"Ormer's Revenge"}, text="Ormer Ironbraid", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=38.2, y=50.9},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={295}, names={"Ormer's Revenge"}, text="Ormer Ironbraid. Scytheclaws and Razormaws are 25-27: kept for segment 10.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=38.2, y=50.9},
  {t="T", seg=8, q={306}, names={"In Search of The Excavation Team"}, text="Take the road back to Menethil Harbor. Tarrel Rockweaver, on the north side of town.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=11.5, y=52.2},
  {t="T", seg=8, q={484}, names={"Young Crocolisk Skins"}, text="James Halloran", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=8.6, y=55.7},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={471}, names={"Apprentice's Duties"}, text="James Halloran. Giant Crocolisks are 25-26: kept for segment 10.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=8.6, y=55.7},
  {t="T", seg=8, q={279}, names={"Claws from the Deep"}, text="Karl Boran", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=8.3, y=58.6},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={281}, names={"Reclaiming Goods"}, text="Karl Boran", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=8.3, y=58.6},
  {t="T", seg=8, q={98282}, names={"Alchemical Hazards"}, text="Caitlin Grassman", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=11.9, y=58.8},
  {t="T", seg=8, q={470}, names={"Digging Through the Ooze"}, text="Sida", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=11.8, y=58.0},
  {t="T", seg=8, q={281}, names={"Reclaiming Goods"}, text="Back to the Bluegill camps on the coast north of town. Click the Damaged Crate (13.5, 41.4).", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=13.5, y=41.4},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={284}, names={"The Search Continues"}, text="From the Damaged Crate", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=13.5, y=41.4},
  {t="T", seg=8, q={284}, names={"The Search Continues"}, text="The Sealed Barrel, a little further north (13.6, 38.2)", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=13.6, y=38.2},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={285}, names={"Search More Hovels"}, text="From the Sealed Barrel", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=13.6, y=38.2},
  {t="T", seg=8, q={285}, names={"Search More Hovels"}, text="The Half-buried Barrel in the northern camp (13.9, 34.8). Murlocs stand right next to each container: clear them first with the Voidwalker, a click is interrupted when you are hit.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=13.9, y=34.8},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={286}, names={"Return the Statuette"}, text="From the Half-buried Barrel", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=13.9, y=34.8},
  {t="T", seg=8, q={286}, names={"Return the Statuette"}, text="Karl Boran, by the Menethil docks", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=8.3, y=58.6},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={98189}, names={"Return the Statuette"}, text="Karl Boran: Return the Statuette (new in Forever)", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=8.4, y=58.5},
  {t="T", seg=8, q={98189}, names={"Return the Statuette"}, text="Captain Stoutfist, inside Menethil Keep. Do not take his other quests yet: they belong to segment 10.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=9.9, y=57.4},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=8, text="Optional, about 10 minutes: fly from Menethil Harbor to Ironforge and back. Briarthorn, the warlock trainer in the Forlorn Cavern in the north of the city: learn everything he offers at level 24, and look at the demon trainer beside him for new Voidwalker spell books. The route's next training stop is Ironforge at level 28. Press Skip if you would rather go on.", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=50.4, y=5.7},
  {t="A", seg=8, q={971}, names={"Knowledge in the Deeps"}, text="Gerrig Bonegrip in the Forlorn Cavern. The Lorgalis Manuscript is under water in the first big pool inside.", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=50.8, y=5.6, dg=4},
  {t="N", seg=8, arg="Take the boat from Menethil Harbor to Auberdine", text="Buy food and water first. Not verified for Forever: a quest text says the Auberdine boat stops in Southshore on the way over. If it does, stay on board until Auberdine in Darkshore."},
  {t="F", seg=9, arg="Auberdine", text="Walk off the dock into Auberdine. Caylais Moonfeather, the hippogryph master, stands at the foot of the dock.", zone="Darkshore", map=1439, x=36.3, y=45.6},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={97894}, names={"Business in Auberdine"}, text="Gorbold Steelhand, at a merchant stall in Auberdine: the message from his brother in Stormwind", zone="Darkshore", map=1439, x=38.1, y=41.2},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={729}, names={"The Absent Minded Prospector"}, text="Archaeologist Hollee, the dwarf in the north part of the village", zone="Darkshore", map=1439, x=37.4, y=41.8},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={965}, names={"The Tower of Althalaxx"}, text="Sentinel Elissa Starbreeze, in the building on the east side of the village", zone="Darkshore", map=1439, x=39.0, y=43.6},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={965}, names={"The Tower of Althalaxx"}, text="Follow the road north out of Auberdine and turn east where the land rises toward the Tower of Althalaxx. Balthule Shadowstrike hides below the tower (55.0, 24.9).", zone="Darkshore", map=1439, x=55.0, y=24.9},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={966}, names={"The Tower of Althalaxx"}, text="Balthule Shadowstrike", zone="Darkshore", map=1439, x=55.0, y=24.9},
  {t="C", seg=9, q={966}, names={"The Tower of Althalaxx"}, text="Dark Strand Fanatics (16-17) camp around the tower: kill them for 4 Worn Parchments. They are far below you. Do not climb the tower: Athrikus Narassin (31) is at the top.", zone="Darkshore", map=1439, x=56.3, y=26.7},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={966}, names={"The Tower of Althalaxx"}, text="Balthule Shadowstrike", zone="Darkshore", map=1439, x=55.0, y=24.9},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={967}, names={"The Tower of Althalaxx"}, text="Balthule Shadowstrike. A letter for Maestra's Post in Ashenvale.", zone="Darkshore", map=1439, x=55.0, y=24.9},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={729}, names={"The Absent Minded Prospector"}, text="Run back past Auberdine and take the road south, a long way. Near the south end of Darkshore leave the road to the west: Prospector Remtravel stands in his dig (35.7, 83.7). Do not take his escort (elite).", zone="Darkshore", map=1439, x=35.7, y=83.7, path={{52.4,28.3},{49.2,28.3},{48.0,30.1},{47.6,39.7},{44.2,42.7},{43.6,49.6},{39.6,53.7},{38.8,58.8},{39.0,69.6},{38.2,71.1},{38.4,80.4}}},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={945}, names={"Therylune's Escape"}, text="Therylune is in the Master's Glaive, the ruin just south-east of the dig (38.6, 87.3). Kill the cultists around her first.", zone="Darkshore", map=1439, x=38.6, y=87.3},
  {t="C", seg=9, q={945}, names={"Therylune's Escape"}, text="Escort: walk with Therylune until she is out of the Master's Glaive. Stay ahead of her and let the Voidwalker take what attacks; everything here is far below you.", zone="Darkshore", map=1439, x=38.6, y=87.3},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={5321}, names={"The Sleeper Has Awakened"}, text="Go north-east to the Grove of the Ancients, beside the road (44.4, 76.4). Kerlonian Evershade sleeps there.", zone="Darkshore", map=1439, x=44.4, y=76.4},
  {t="C", seg=9, q={5321}, names={"The Sleeper Has Awakened"}, text="Take the Horn of Awakening out of Kerlonian's Chest next to him, then escort Kerlonian south along the road. He follows you and keeps falling asleep: use the Horn of Awakening on him each time. Stay on the road and do not run ahead of him. Changed in Forever: the objective now reads \"escort Kerlonian on the road south to his bag\", still in Darkshore, so the escort part may end before Ashenvale. The hand-in is still listed at Maestra's Post.", zone="Darkshore", map=1439, x=40.9, y=85.9},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={5321}, names={"The Sleeper Has Awakened"}, text="Maestra's Post is the first camp on the road inside Ashenvale. Liladris Moonriver stands at its north end (27.3, 35.6).", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=27.3, y=35.6},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={967}, names={"The Tower of Althalaxx"}, text="Delgren the Purifier, in the camp (26.2, 38.7)", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=26.2, y=38.7},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={970}, names={"The Tower of Althalaxx"}, text="Delgren the Purifier", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=26.2, y=38.7},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1010}, names={"Bathran's Hair"}, text="Orendil Broadleaf, next to him", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=26.4, y=38.6},
  {t="C", seg=9, q={970}, names={"The Tower of Althalaxx"}, text="The Dark Strand cultists dig in the ruins north-east of Maestra's Post (around 31, 31). Kill Cultists, Adepts, Excavators (18-20) and the Enforcer until one drops the Glowing Soul Gem.", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=31.3, y=30.8},
  {t="C", seg=9, q={1010}, names={"Bathran's Hair"}, text="Bathran's Haunt is further north (around 32, 23). Pick 5 Bathran's Hair from the Plant Bundles on the ground between the Forsaken there (18-20).", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=31.7, y=23.0},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1010}, names={"Bathran's Hair"}, text="Back at Maestra's Post: Orendil Broadleaf", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=26.4, y=38.6},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1020}, names={"Orendil's Cure"}, text="Orendil Broadleaf. His cure goes to Astranaar.", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=26.4, y=38.6},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={970}, names={"The Tower of Althalaxx"}, text="Delgren the Purifier", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=26.2, y=38.7},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={973}, names={"The Tower of Althalaxx"}, text="Delgren the Purifier", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=26.2, y=38.7},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={945}, names={"Therylune's Escape"}, text="Go south from Maestra's Post, across the road. Therysil stands at the Shrine of Aessina (22.6, 51.9).", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=22.6, y=51.9},
  {t="C", seg=9, q={973}, names={"The Tower of Althalaxx"}, text="Fire Scar Shrine is just south of the Shrine of Aessina. Ilkrud Magthrull (24) stands in the middle of it (25.3, 60.7) with Felslayers (22-23) all around. Clear a path of Felslayers one at a time (they drain mana: kill them fast), then put a Soulstone on yourself and fight Ilkrud at full health and mana. He casts Shadow Bolts and a warlock has no interrupt: send the Voidwalker, put Corruption, Curse of Agony and Immolate on him and burn him down with Shadow Bolt; use Drain Life when your health drops and the Healthstone in an emergency. He can call a helper: Fear the helper and kill Ilkrud first unless the helper is nearly dead. He drops Ilkrud Magthrull's Tome. You hand it in when you pass Maestra's Post again.", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=25.3, y=60.7},
  {t="F", seg=9, arg="Astranaar", text="Go back north to the road and follow it east to Astranaar, the town on the island in the lake. Daelyshia, the hippogryph master, stands at the west entrance.", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=34.4, y=48.0},
  {t="S", seg=9, arg="Astranaar", text="Innkeeper Kimlya in the inn", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=37.0, y=49.2},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1008}, names={"The Zoram Strand"}, text="Shindrell Swiftfire, near the west entrance", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=34.7, y=48.8},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={991}, names={"Raene's Cleansing"}, text="Raene Wolfrunner, in the building in the middle of town", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=36.6, y=49.6},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1020}, names={"Orendil's Cure"}, text="Pelturas Whitemoon, in the house at the south-east end of town", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=37.4, y=51.8},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1033}, names={"Elune's Tear"}, text="Pelturas Whitemoon", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=37.4, y=51.8},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={991}, names={"Raene's Cleansing"}, text="Take the road west out of Astranaar and leave it to the north-west for Lake Falathim. Teronis' Corpse lies at the lake (20.3, 42.3).", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=20.3, y=42.3},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1023}, names={"Raene's Cleansing"}, text="From Teronis' Corpse", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=20.3, y=42.3},
  {t="C", seg=9, q={1023}, names={"Raene's Cleansing"}, text="Saltspittle murlocs (19-21) around the lake: kill them until one drops the Glowing Gem.", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=20.4, y=42.7},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1007}, names={"The Ancient Statuette"}, text="Keep north-west to the coast. Talen camps above the Zoram Strand (14.8, 31.3). The Horde has a camp on the shore south-west of him (Classic knowledge, not checked for Forever): stay away from its guards.", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=14.8, y=31.3},
  {t="C", seg=9, q={1007}, names={"The Ancient Statuette"}, text="The Ancient Statuette lies on the strand north of Talen (14.2, 20.6). Fight your way there through the Wrathtail naga and count their heads.", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=14.2, y=20.6},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1007}, names={"The Ancient Statuette"}, text="Talen", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=14.8, y=31.3},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1009}, names={"Ruuzel"}, text="Talen", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=14.8, y=31.3},
  {t="C", seg=9, q={1009,1008}, names={"Ruuzel","The Zoram Strand"}, text="Kill naga along the strand until you have 20 Wrathtail Heads: Wave Riders and Sorceresses (18-19) on the near side, Razortails and Sea Witches (19-20) further out, Myrmidons and Priestesses (20-21) at the north end. Ruuzel (22) stands with her guards on the small island at the north end (7.2, 13.1): send the Voidwalker at the guards one at a time from as far away as you can, then kill her for the Ring of Zoram. Sorceresses, Sea Witches and Priestesses are casters and some heal: a warlock has no interrupt, so kill them first with all three DoTs and Shadow Bolt while the Voidwalker holds the melee naga, or Fear a second caster where no other naga stand near. Lady Vespia, a rare elite who walks the strand, also carries the ring: leave her unless she is alone and you are at full health.", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=9.0, y=18.0},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1009}, names={"Ruuzel"}, text="Talen", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=14.8, y=31.3},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={973}, names={"The Tower of Althalaxx"}, text="Walk back east to Maestra's Post: Delgren the Purifier", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=26.2, y=38.7},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={976}, names={"Supplies to Auberdine"}, text="Feero Ironhand, standing next to Delgren. This starts an escort with three ambushes.", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=26.2, y=38.9},
  {t="C", seg=9, q={976}, names={"Supplies to Auberdine"}, text="Walk with Feero. Three groups attack one after the other, the last one the strongest. Eat and drink to full before you talk to him. In each ambush send the Voidwalker at the attackers so it holds them off Feero, and kill the casters first (you have no interrupt: DoT them and burn them down). You cannot heal Feero. Use Health Funnel on the Voidwalker and bandage or eat between waves if there is time; keep the Healthstone for the last wave. Feero fights too, but he must survive.", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=26.2, y=38.9},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={976}, names={"Supplies to Auberdine"}, text="Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=26.2, y=38.7},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1008}, names={"The Zoram Strand"}, text="Back along the road to Astranaar: Shindrell Swiftfire", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=34.7, y=48.8},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1134}, names={"Pridewings of Stonetalon"}, text="Shindrell Swiftfire. The wyverns are in Stonetalon, later in this segment.", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=34.7, y=48.8},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1023}, names={"Raene's Cleansing"}, text="Raene Wolfrunner", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=36.6, y=49.6},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1024,1025,1054}, names={"Raene's Cleansing","An Aggressive Defense","Culling the Threat"}, text="Raene Wolfrunner", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=36.6, y=49.6},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1070}, names={"On Guard in Stonetalon"}, text="Sentinel Thenysil, on the west side of town", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=34.9, y=49.8},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1056}, names={"Journey to Stonetalon Peak"}, text="Faldreas Goeth'Shael, near Raene's building", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=35.8, y=49.1},
  {t="C", seg=9, q={1054}, names={"Culling the Threat"}, text="Thistlefur Village is in the hills north of Astranaar. Dal Bloodclaw (25) stands at 37.7, 34.7 among Thistlefur furbolgs (23-24), among them Thistlefur Shamans, who heal. Pull single furbolgs with the Voidwalker on the way in and kill the healers first (you cannot interrupt a heal: put all three DoTs on and burn them down). Fear a second furbolg only at the edge of the village: a feared one brings friends. Fight Dal at full health with nothing else near him: Soulstone on yourself, Voidwalker first, Drain Life when he turns on you. Loot his skull.", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=37.7, y=34.7},
  {t="C", seg=9, q={1033}, names={"Elune's Tear"}, text="Come back down to the road and follow it east to Iris Lake, north of the road. Elune's Tear lies on the small island in the lake (46.4, 46.4): pick one up.", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=46.4, y=46.4},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1024}, names={"Raene's Cleansing"}, text="Shael'dryn stands at the moonwell further east, north of the road (53.5, 46.2)", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=53.5, y=46.2},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1026}, names={"Raene's Cleansing"}, text="Shael'dryn. Keep this one: the rod pieces are for the second Ashenvale trip (segment 13).", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=53.5, y=46.2},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1054}, names={"Culling the Threat"}, text="Back to Astranaar: Raene Wolfrunner", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=36.6, y=49.6, path={{52.6,50.7},{49.8,51.6},{48.2,54.0},{44.8,54.0},{43.2,48.4},{36.8,48.1}}},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1033}, names={"Elune's Tear"}, text="Pelturas Whitemoon", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=37.4, y=51.8},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1034}, names={"The Ruins of Stardust"}, text="Pelturas Whitemoon", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=37.4, y=51.8},
  {t="C", seg=9, q={1034}, names={"The Ruins of Stardust"}, text="Leave Astranaar and go south. The Ruins of Stardust are on the island in the lake south of town (33.3, 67.8): pick 5 Handfuls of Stardust from the Stardust Covered Bushes.", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=33.3, y=67.8},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1016}, names={"Elemental Bracers"}, text="Go east along the south side of the zone, past the mouth of the Talondeep Path, to Silverwind Refuge on the shore of Mystral Lake. Sentinel Velene Starstrike is there (49.8, 67.2).", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=49.8, y=67.2},
  {t="C", seg=9, q={1016}, names={"Elemental Bracers"}, text="Befouled Water Elementals (23-25) walk in and around Mystral Lake. Send the Voidwalker at one at a time and kill them for 5 Intact Elemental Bracers, then right-click the Divining Scroll she gave you to make the Divined Scroll.", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=49.0, y=70.4},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1016}, names={"Elemental Bracers"}, text="Sentinel Velene Starstrike", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=49.8, y=67.2},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1017}, names={"Mage Summoner"}, text="Sentinel Velene Starstrike", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=49.8, y=67.2},
  {t="C", seg=9, q={1025}, names={"An Aggressive Defense"}, text="The Foulweald furbolgs live in Greenpaw Village, north-east of Silverwind Refuge (49-58, 60-65). Kill 1 Den Watcher, 2 Ursas (both 24-25, in the middle of the village), 10 Totemics and 12 Warriors (23-24). The Totemics heal and set down wards: kill them first (you cannot interrupt their heals: all three DoTs, then Shadow Bolt) and destroy the wards with your wand. Pull from the edge with the Voidwalker so you fight two at most; Fear the second one only when no other group is near.", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=53.3, y=62.0},
  {t="C", seg=9, q={1017}, names={"Mage Summoner"}, text="Sarilus Foulborne (25) stands on the island in the middle of Mystral Lake. Clear the elementals near the island, then fight him at full health and mana, with a Soulstone on yourself. He is a caster and you have no interrupt: send the Voidwalker, put Corruption, Curse of Agony and Immolate on him and burn him down; Drain Life keeps you up. If he has a summoned servant with him, let the Voidwalker hold it and kill Sarilus first. Loot his head. (Questie files him under a Barrens map position; the lake is where the quest sends you.)", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=49.0, y=70.4},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1017}, names={"Mage Summoner"}, text="Sentinel Velene Starstrike", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=49.8, y=67.2},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={98027}, names={"Gleaming Crescent Necklace"}, text="Only if you are level 25, otherwise press Skip here and on its hand-in. A Gleaming Crescent Pendant lies on the ground east of Mystral Lake (63.0, 71.5): clicking it starts a level 29 quest (new in Forever). The woods out there are above your level: run in, take the pendant and leave.", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=63.0, y=71.5, path={{48.4,65.7},{49.2,63.9},{57.2,64.2},{58.6,66.3},{59.4,70.8},{60.4,72.0}}},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1070}, names={"On Guard in Stonetalon"}, text="Go back west to the Talondeep Path, the tunnel in the southern cliffs (entrance at Ashenvale 42.3, 71.0), and run through it into the Stonetalon Mountains. You come out in Windshear Crag. Kaela Shadowspear watches the valley from its south-west side (59.9, 66.8).", zone="Stonetalon Mountains", map=1442, x=59.9, y=66.8},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1085}, names={"On Guard in Stonetalon"}, text="Kaela Shadowspear", zone="Stonetalon Mountains", map=1442, x=59.9, y=66.8},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1085}, names={"On Guard in Stonetalon"}, text="Gaxim Rustfizzle, a few steps from her", zone="Stonetalon Mountains", map=1442, x=59.5, y=67.1},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1071}, names={"A Gnome's Respite"}, text="Gaxim Rustfizzle", zone="Stonetalon Mountains", map=1442, x=59.5, y=67.2},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1093}, names={"Super Reaper 6000"}, text="Ziz Fizziks, in the small hut a little north (59.0, 62.6)", zone="Stonetalon Mountains", map=1442, x=59, y=62.6},
  {t="C", seg=9, q={1071,1093}, names={"A Gnome's Respite","Super Reaper 6000"}, text="The Venture Co. camps fill Windshear Crag north-east of here. Kill 10 Loggers (18-19) and 10 Deforesters (19-20), and Operators (19-20, around the machines) until one drops the Super Reaper 6000 Blueprints.", zone="Stonetalon Mountains", map=1442, x=65.9, y=52.6},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1090}, names={"Gerenzo's Orders"}, text="Piznik stands at the back of the Windshear Mine, the kobold mine in the south-east wall of the crag (71.9, 60.0). Kill the Windshear kobolds (20-22) on the way in.", zone="Stonetalon Mountains", map=1442, x=71.9, y=60.0, path={{74.1,59.6}}, cave=true},
  {t="C", seg=9, q={1090}, names={"Gerenzo's Orders"}, text="Piznik starts mining and kobolds attack in waves until he is done. Start at full health. Stand at the tunnel in front of him and send the Voidwalker at each wave so the kobolds stay off him; you cannot heal him. Kill each wave one kobold at a time, and use Health Funnel on the Voidwalker and bandage or eat between waves. He must survive.", zone="Stonetalon Mountains", map=1442, x=71.9, y=60.0, path={{74.1,59.6}}, cave=true},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1090}, names={"Gerenzo's Orders"}, text="Piznik", zone="Stonetalon Mountains", map=1442, x=71.9, y=60.0},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={1092}, names={"Gerenzo's Orders"}, text="Piznik", zone="Stonetalon Mountains", map=1442, x=71.9, y=60.0},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1092,1093}, names={"Gerenzo's Orders","Super Reaper 6000"}, text="Ziz Fizziks. Do not take Further Instructions (it sends you to Ratchet).", zone="Stonetalon Mountains", map=1442, x=59.0, y=62.6, path={{69.4,58.2},{64.2,58.2},{61.2,62.7}}},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1071}, names={"A Gnome's Respite"}, text="Gaxim Rustfizzle. Do not take An Old Colleague (it sends you to Ironforge and Stormwind).", zone="Stonetalon Mountains", map=1442, x=59.5, y=67.2},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={86574}, names={"Stonetalon Supply Run"}, text="Follow the road west and then north through the mountains to Mirkfallon Lake. On the way it passes below Sun Rock Retreat, a Horde town (Classic knowledge): stay on the road and do not go up the side path. The body of the Night Elf Courier lies at the lake (48.6, 39.8): Stonetalon Supply Run (new in Forever).", zone="Stonetalon Mountains", map=1442, x=48.6, y=39.8},
  {t="C", seg=9, q={86574,1134}, names={"Stonetalon Supply Run","Pridewings of Stonetalon"}, text="Pridewing wyverns fly all around Mirkfallon Lake: Wyverns (21-22), Consorts (22-23) and Skyhunters (23-24). Kill them for 12 Pridewing Venom Sacs and 6 Stonetalon Supply Bundles (the new quest's bundles come from the same wyverns). They poison you and a warlock cannot cure poison: let the Voidwalker hold them, use Drain Life in the fight, and bandage and eat between fights. Leave the Pridewing Patriarch (25, rare elite) alone.", zone="Stonetalon Mountains", map=1442, x=50.6, y=43.0},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={86574}, names={"Stonetalon Supply Run"}, text="Take the road north from the lake up to Stonetalon Peak. Innkeeper Faralia is in the inn (35.7, 5.8).", zone="Stonetalon Mountains", map=1442, x=35.7, y=5.8, path={{51.8,42.4},{51.8,39.1},{50.0,34.0},{50.0,30.4},{49.0,28.9},{45.2,28.0},{44.0,25.9},{43.2,15.1},{41.6,12.7},{39.4,12.1},{39.4,8.2},{37.8,5.8}}},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1056}, names={"Journey to Stonetalon Peak"}, text="Keeper Albagorm, the big Keeper of the Grove on the hill (37.1, 8.1). Do not take his follow-up.", zone="Stonetalon Mountains", map=1442, x=37.1, y=8.1},
  {t="F", seg=9, arg="Stonetalon Peak", text="Teloren, the hippogryph master", zone="Stonetalon Mountains", map=1442, x=36.4, y=7.2},
  {t="FLY", seg=9, arg="Astranaar", text="Teloren. If the flight is not offered, use your hearthstone: it is bound in Astranaar."},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1134}, names={"Pridewings of Stonetalon"}, text="Shindrell Swiftfire", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=34.7, y=48.8},
  {t="A", seg=9, q={95737}, names={"Seeking Caitlin"}, text="Llana in Astranaar. It only sends you to Caitlin Grassman in Menethil Harbor.", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=34.9, y=48.5, dg=5},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1025}, names={"An Aggressive Defense"}, text="Raene Wolfrunner", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=36.6, y=49.6},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={1034}, names={"The Ruins of Stardust"}, text="Pelturas Whitemoon", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=37.4, y=51.8},
  {t="T", seg=9, q={98027}, names={"Gleaming Crescent Necklace"}, text="Maliynn, in the building next to Raene (36.6, 49.9). Press Skip if you never picked up the pendant.", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=36.6, y=49.9},
  {t="N", seg=9, arg="Optional dungeon: Blackfathom Deeps, levels 24-32", text="The entrance is on the north-west coast of Ashenvale, north of the Zoram Strand: go down through the ruins and the tunnels to the portal. Inside: Argent Guard Thaelrid ends In Search of Thaelrid and gives Blackfathom Villainy (the head of Twilight Lord Kelris, for Dawnwatcher Selgorm in Darnassus). Quests you picked up for it: Knowledge in the Deeps. Not on your path, only if you want the detour: Twilight Falls (Darnassus 55, 24); In Search of Thaelrid (Darnassus 55, 25). Needs an earlier quest chain this route does not do: Researching the Corruption. The route does not come back to these hand-ins, go when it suits you: Blackfathom Villainy (Darnassus).", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=14.5, y=14.2, dg=4, run=true},
  {t="FLY", seg=9, arg="Auberdine", text="Daelyshia, at the west entrance of Astranaar"},
  {t="N", seg=9, arg="Take the boat from Auberdine to Menethil Harbor", text="Check on the dock which boat it is: one pier goes to Menethil Harbor, the other to Darnassus. Raene's Cleansing stays in your log."},
  {t="S", seg=10, arg="Menethil Harbor", text="You step off the boat from Auberdine. Bind at the Deepwater Tavern (Innkeeper Helbrek): you hearth back here after the first loop", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=10.7, y=60.9},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={473}, names={"Report to Captain Stoutfist"}, text="Valstag Ironjaw, in front of Menethil Keep (10.1,56.9)", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=10.1, y=56.9},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={473}, names={"Report to Captain Stoutfist"}, text="Captain Stoutfist, inside Menethil Keep", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=9.9, y=57.5},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={464}, names={"War Banners"}, text="Captain Stoutfist", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=9.9, y=57.5},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={98221}, names={"From the Ashes"}, text="Captain Stoutfist (new in Forever)", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=9.9, y=57.4},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={98230}, names={"This Land Was Their Land"}, text="Captain Stoutfist (new in Forever): a walk to Howin Kindfeather, far east along the road", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=9.9, y=57.4},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={98190}, names={"A Friend of the Family"}, text="Captain Stoutfist (new in Forever). The Menethil Statuette goes to Stormwind Keep in the next segment: keep it in your bags", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=9.9, y=57.4},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={472}, names={"Fall of Dun Modr"}, text="Harlo Barnaby (10.8,55.9). Needs level 25. Just a walk to Dun Modr: you hand it in in segment 12", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=10.8, y=55.9},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={98208}, names={"Bloom of the Heavens"}, text="Sylessa Duskwhisper (new in Forever), near the tanner. Her flower is in the wreck south of town: you get it after the first loop", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=8.0, y=55.9},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={288}, names={"The Third Fleet"}, text="First Mate Fitzsimmons, by the docks", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=10.9, y=59.6},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={288}, names={"The Third Fleet"}, text="Buy a Flagon of Mead from Innkeeper Helbrek in the Deepwater Tavern", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=10.7, y=60.9},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={288}, names={"The Third Fleet"}, text="First Mate Fitzsimmons", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=10.9, y=59.6},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={289}, names={"The Cursed Crew"}, text="First Mate Fitzsimmons", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=10.9, y=59.6},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={471}, names={"Apprentice's Duties"}, text="Leave by the bridge and go north along the coast. Giant Wetlands Crocolisks (25-26) swim in the river mouths at 15-27,19-29, next to the shipwrecks. Kill until you have 6 skins. Fen Creepers (24-25, stealthed in the water at 18-24,27-32) count for Blisters on the Land: kill the ones you meet", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=19.0, y=25.0},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={289}, names={"The Cursed Crew"}, text="The two wrecks on the north coast (13-16,23-31). Cursed Sailors (26-27) are mostly around the southern wreck, Cursed Marines (27-28) around the northern one; First Mate Snellig (29) stands in the southern wreck at 13.8,30.2. They often come in twos: send the Voidwalker at one from as far away as you can, Fear the other (not toward the next group), kill the first with Corruption, Curse of Agony, Immolate and Shadow Bolt, then the second; Drain Life, eat, drink or bandage between pulls. Clear around Snellig first, then fight him at full health with a Soulstone on yourself and the Voidwalker on him", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=14.3, y=26.9},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={471}, names={"Apprentice's Duties"}, text="Walk back to Menethil Harbor. James Halloran, the tanner", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=8.5, y=55.7},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={98072}, names={"Crocs of the Sky"}, text="James Halloran (new in Forever). The whelps are far to the east; you get them at the end of this loop", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=8.5, y=55.8},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={289}, names={"The Cursed Crew"}, text="First Mate Fitzsimmons", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=10.9, y=59.6},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={290}, names={"Lifting the Curse"}, text="First Mate Fitzsimmons", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=10.9, y=59.6},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={290}, names={"Lifting the Curse"}, text="Back north to the far (northern) wreck. Captain Halyndor (30) stands on it at 15.4,23.6 with Marines around him. Pull the Marines away one at a time with the Voidwalker first, then fight Halyndor alone at full health and mana, Soulstone on yourself: Voidwalker first, all three DoTs, Shadow Bolt, Drain Life when he turns on you, and Sacrifice plus the Healthstone if it goes wrong. He is four levels above you, so your spells will sometimes be resisted; walk away and start again if a Marine joins. He drops the Intrepid Strongbox Key", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=15.4, y=23.6},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={290}, names={"Lifting the Curse"}, text="Intrepid's Locked Strongbox, in the same wreck (14.4,24.0)", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=14.4, y=24.0},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={292}, names={"The Eye of Paleth"}, text="The same strongbox", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=14.4, y=24.0},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={299}, names={"Uncovering the Past"}, text="Go south-east across the marsh to Whelgar's Excavation Site (stay north of the road until you are past the murloc coast). Prospector Whelgar stands at the camp on the east rim of the dig (38.8,52.4)", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=38.8, y=52.4},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={295,299}, names={"Ormer's Revenge","Uncovering the Past"}, text="Down in the dig (31-36,44-52): kill 10 Mottled Scytheclaws and 10 Mottled Razormaws (25-27) and pick up the four tablet fragments. Ados, Modr and Golm are in Ancient Relics (stone tablets), Neru is in a Loose Soil mound; they sit in different spots each time, so check 34.1,49.9 / 35.2,51.5 / 34.2,47.7 / 33.1,46.4 and the north end around 34.3,44.5 and 36.5,42.1. Raptors often come in pairs: send the Voidwalker from far away, fight at the edge of the dig, Fear the second raptor (away from the middle of the dig) and kill one at a time", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=34.0, y=48.0},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={295}, names={"Ormer's Revenge"}, text="Ormer Ironbraid, next to Whelgar", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=38.2, y=50.9},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={296}, names={"Ormer's Revenge"}, text="Ormer Ironbraid", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=38.2, y=50.9},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={296}, names={"Ormer's Revenge"}, text="Sarltooth (29) is at the south-west side of the dig (33.3,51.5). Clear the raptors near him first and fight him at full health. He hits hard for your level: let the Voidwalker take him and give it a moment before you put Corruption, Curse of Agony and Immolate on, keep it alive with Health Funnel, and if he turns on you Fear him and let the DoTs work. Use Drain Life, the Healthstone or a healing potion early rather than late", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=33.3, y=51.5},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={296}, names={"Ormer's Revenge"}, text="Ormer Ironbraid", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=38.2, y=50.9},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={299}, names={"Uncovering the Past"}, text="Prospector Whelgar", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=38.8, y=52.4},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={98221}, obj={1}, names={"From the Ashes"}, text="Go north-east. The first set of Attack Plans lies at the small Dragonmaw post west of the Angerfang Encampment (38.6,46.1). Click it to destroy it. Which of the four plans lies where is not in the data: if this spot is empty, go on and tick it later", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=38.6, y=46.1},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={464,98221}, names={"War Banners","From the Ashes"}, text="Angerfang Encampment (39-52,40-49). Any Dragonmaw drops War Banners (8 needed): Raiders (26-27) and Bonewarders (27, casters: a warlock has no interrupt, so put Curse of Tongues on them and kill them first). The other Attack Plans are at about 45.5,42.6, 45.3,45.5 and 49.4,46.6. Fight at the edges, one tent at a time, Voidwalker first, and do not Fear inside the camp: a feared orc brings friends; the Dragonmaw Battlemaster (rare, 30) walks the middle: avoid him. Leave the catapults for the next loop", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=45.5, y=44.5},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={98230}, names={"This Land Was Their Land"}, text="Howin Kindfeather, just north of the encampment beside the road (49.4,42.1)", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=49.4, y=42.1},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={98246}, names={"Trying Times"}, text="Howin Kindfeather (new in Forever). The eggs come from Raptor Ridge in the next loop. If he does not offer it yet, he will after Razormaw Needling in loop B", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=49.4, y=42.1},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={275}, names={"Blisters on The Land"}, text="Finish the 8 Fen Creepers in the water around Rethiel's island (53-55,36-46); they are stealthed until you are close", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=54.5, y=41.0},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={275}, names={"Blisters on The Land"}, text="Rethiel the Greenwarden (56.4,40.4)", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=56.4, y=40.4},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={95646}, names={"Horrors in the Highland"}, text="Rethiel the Greenwarden. The root core of a Highland Horror inside.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=56.2, y=40.5, dg=5},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={98072}, names={"Crocs of the Sky"}, text="Crimson Whelps (25-26) fly over the Green Belt east of Rethiel (57-70,31-51). Collect 10 Pristine Crimson Scales. Their fire bolt is a cast you cannot interrupt: let the Voidwalker take it, or put Curse of Tongues on the whelp to slow it, and use Drain Life to stay up. Stay north of the orcs in the hills", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=61.0, y=40.0},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={98223}, names={"Old Habits"}, text="Go south-west to the Dragonmaw camp south of the road. The Tattered Spellbook lies on the ground at 53.5,54.5 (new in Forever). Dragonmaw Centurions and Shadowwarders (28-29) stand around it: send the Voidwalker at one at a time, kill the Shadowwarders (casters) first with Curse of Tongues on them (you have no interrupt), and finish your 8 War Banners here if you are short. You keep this quest until segment 12", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=53.5, y=54.5, path={{60.0,49.9},{57.2,54.0}}},
  {t="H", seg=10, arg="Menethil Harbor", text="Hearthstone back to Menethil Harbor"},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={464}, names={"War Banners"}, text="Captain Stoutfist", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=9.9, y=57.5},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={465}, names={"Nek'rosh's Gambit"}, text="Captain Stoutfist. Do not take Defeat Nek'rosh later: it is an elite fight", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=9.9, y=57.5},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={98221}, names={"From the Ashes"}, text="Captain Stoutfist. Keep Old Habits (98223) and A Friend of the Family (98190) in the log for later segments", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=9.9, y=57.4},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={98072}, names={"Crocs of the Sky"}, text="James Halloran", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=8.5, y=55.8},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={98240}, names={"Crimson Crate Delivery"}, text="James Halloran (new in Forever): a crate for Howin Kindfeather", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=8.5, y=55.8},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={292}, names={"The Eye of Paleth"}, text="Glorin Steelbrow, at the Deepwater Tavern (10.6,60.6)", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=10.6, y=60.6},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={293}, names={"Cleansing the Eye"}, text="Glorin Steelbrow. The eye goes to the Cathedral in Stormwind in the next segment", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=10.6, y=60.6},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={95647}, names={"Lost in the Thicket Things"}, text="Caitlin Grassman in Menethil Harbor. Find out what happened to her husband Ardin inside.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=11.9, y=58.8, dg=5},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={98208}, names={"Bloom of the Heavens"}, text="The wreck just south of town, across the water from the docks (about 12,64). Bluegill Raiders (28-29) live in and around it; kill them and search the wreck for Nord'el. Whether the flower drops or is picked up is not in the data: loot every murloc and click anything that sparkles. Send the Voidwalker at one murloc at a time. They run at low health and bring friends: do not Fear here, keep Corruption and Curse of Agony on them and finish a runner with Shadow Bolt", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=12.1, y=64.2},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={98208}, names={"Bloom of the Heavens"}, text="Sylessa Duskwhisper.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=8.0, y=55.9},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={98209}, names={"Bloom of the Heavens"}, text="Sylessa Duskwhisper: Bloom of the Heavens. Nord'el goes to Auberdine: you carry it until the next boat there", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=8.0, y=55.9},
  {t="N", seg=10, arg="Optional dungeon: Excavation Site: Wetlands, levels 26-31", text="It is in the Wetlands, in the hills above Whelgar's Excavation. Inside: Ardin Grassman's trail leads to Heartwoven (back to Caitlin), the body of a dwarf starts Fallen in the Fen (back to Dorin Songblade in Lakeshire), and the last boss drops a Titan Relic that starts Lost Relic Carry for Prospector Whelgar (Wetlands 38.8, 52.3), who then sends it on to Ironforge. Quests you picked up for it: Seeking Caitlin, Horrors in the Highland, Lost in the Thicket Things. Not on your path, only if you want the detour: Songblade Search (Redridge Mountains 26, 46).", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=47.8, y=56.2, dg=5, run=true},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={95809}, names={"Heartwoven"}, text="Heartwoven: Caitlin Grassman.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=11.9, y=58.8, dg=5},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={98240}, names={"Crimson Crate Delivery"}, text="Follow the road east, past Whelgar's dig, to Howin Kindfeather (49.4,42.1)", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=49.4, y=42.1},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={95646}, names={"Horrors in the Highland"}, zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=56.2, y=40.5, dg=5},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={98245}, names={"Razormaw Needling"}, text="Howin Kindfeather (new in Forever). Take Trying Times (98246) too if he only offers it now", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=49.4, y=42.1},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={98245,98246}, names={"Razormaw Needling","Trying Times"}, text="Raptor Ridge, north-east of Howin (58-72,22-40): Highland Razormaws (27-28) and Elder Razormaws (29) drop the 10 Razormaw Incisors and the 12 Perfect Razormaw Eggs (look for nests on the ground too; the data does not say whether the eggs drop or are picked up). Stay at the south and west edge: the Razormaw Matriarch (rare, 31) is deep inside at 70,29. Raptors often come in pairs: send the Voidwalker from far away, Fear the second raptor (toward the edge, not into the ridge), kill one at a time, and use Health Funnel on the Voidwalker and rest to full between pulls", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=63.0, y=30.5},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={98245}, names={"Razormaw Needling"}, text="Howin Kindfeather", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=49.4, y=42.1},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={98246}, names={"Trying Times"}, text="Howin Kindfeather. Ignore his follow-ups: they are group quests", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=49.4, y=42.1},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={465}, names={"Nek'rosh's Gambit"}, text="Cross the road into the Angerfang Encampment and click a Dragonmaw Catapult (47.5,47.0) to hand in. Do not take Defeat Nek'rosh (elite)", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=47.5, y=47.0},
  {t="FLY", seg=10, arg="Ironforge", text="From the encampment go back to the road and follow it east and then south through the Dun Algaz tunnels (they start at about 53,70 in the Wetlands) into Loch Modan. Keep on the road south to Thelsamar and fly to Ironforge (Thorgrum Borrelson)", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=33.9, y=51.0},
  {t="N", seg=10, arg="Segment done. In the log: 57, 67, 157, 181, 240, 453 (Duskwood/Westfall), 293 and 98190 (Stormwind), 472 and 98223 (segment 12), 1026 (Ashenvale), 98209 (Auberdine)", text="Your hearthstone stays in Menethil Harbor"},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=11, text="Briarthorn, the warlock trainer in the Forlorn Cavern in the north of the city: learn your level 26 and 28 spells (Curse of Tongues at 26, Banish at 28, and every new rank he offers). The demon trainer beside him sells the Voidwalker's spell books. Leave with 3-5 Soul Shards", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=50.4, y=5.7},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={971}, names={"Knowledge in the Deeps"}, zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=50.8, y=5.6, dg=4},
  {t="N", seg=11, arg="Take the Deeprun Tram from Tinker Town to Stormwind", text="It arrives in the Dwarven District"},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={98190}, names={"A Friend of the Family"}, text="Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in the throne room of Stormwind Keep (new in Forever)", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=80.0, y=38.5},
