  {t="A", seg=11, q={1243}, names={"The Missing Diplomat"}, text="Elling Trias. The note goes to Watcher Backus in Darkshire", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=66.0, y=74.1},
  {t="FLY", seg=11, arg="Sentinel Hill", text="Dungar Longdrink, Trade District", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=71.0, y=72.5},
  {t="N", seg=11, arg="Optional dungeon: The Stockade, levels 24-32", text="The Stockade is in Stormwind; Warden Thelwater stands at its door. He also gives The Stockade Riots (Bazil Thredd's head), but only at the end of the long Defias chain that starts with The Unsent Letter from the Deadmines. Quests you picked up for it: What Comes Around..., Crime and Punishment, The Color of Blood, Quell The Uprising. Needs an earlier quest chain this route does not do: The Fury Runs Deep.", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=41.1, y=58.1, dg=3, run=true},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={387}, names={"Quell The Uprising"}, zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=41.1, y=58.1, dg=3},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={388}, names={"The Color of Blood"}, zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=73.4, y=50.7, dg=3},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={67}, names={"The Legend of Stalvan"}, text="Go south-west to Moonbrook. The Old Footlocker is inside the schoolhouse (41.5,66.7). Defias (level 15-20) are no danger now", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=41.5, y=66.7},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={68}, names={"The Legend of Stalvan"}, text="The same footlocker", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=41.5, y=66.7},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={240}, names={"Return to Jitters"}, text="Go east over the river into Duskwood; Raven Hill is right behind the bridge. Jitters is in Raven Hill village (18.4,56.4)", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=18.4, y=56.4},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={453}, names={"Finding the Shadowy Figure"}, text="Jitters", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=18.4, y=56.4},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={268}, names={"Return to Sven"}, text="Jitters", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=18.4, y=56.4},
  {t="N", seg=11, arg="Watch for two new ghosts all over Duskwood: Ira Valor (in the woods) and Merrick Valor (on the roads)", text="New in Forever. Kill them when you see them: one drops Ira's Dagger, the other Merrick's Bow. Each item starts a quest (right-click it). Their exact spots are not in the data. No ghost found? Then skip the steps for 96137 / 96138 / 98447 in this segment"},
  {t="C", seg=11, q={57}, names={"The Night Watch"}, text="The graveyard just north of Jitters (14-24,40-48): kill 15 Skeletal Fiends and 15 Skeletal Horrors (23-25). They are below your level: the Voidwalker can hold two at a time while you put Corruption and Curse of Agony on both and wand them down. Drain Soul a few last hits here to fill up on Soul Shards", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=20.0, y=45.0},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={268}, names={"Return to Sven"}, text="Sven Yorgen, at his camp on the far west side (7.8,34.1)", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=7.8, y=34.1},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={323}, names={"Proving Your Worth"}, text="Sven Yorgen", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=7.8, y=34.1},
  {t="C", seg=11, q={323}, names={"Proving Your Worth"}, text="The northern part of the cemetery, around the crypts and the big mausoleum (13-20,27-41): 15 Skeletal Raiders (27-28), 3 Skeletal Healers (26-27), 3 Skeletal Warders (28-29). Send the Voidwalker first. Kill the Healers first: you have no interrupt, so put Curse of Tongues on them (it slows their heals) and all your DoTs. Curse of Tongues slows the Warders' bolts too. Do not Fear here: a feared skeleton runs into the next group. Stay outside the crypts: Morbent Fel's house and the crypt depths are elite territory", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=16.2, y=35.3},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={225}, names={"The Weathered Grave"}, text="A Weathered Grave, at the north edge of the cemetery (17.7,29.1). Needs level 28", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=17.7, y=29.1},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={323}, names={"Proving Your Worth"}, text="Back to Sven Yorgen", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=7.8, y=34.1},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={269}, names={"Seeking Wisdom"}, text="Sven Yorgen. For Stormwind, later in this segment", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=7.8, y=34.1},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={157}, names={"Deliver the Thread"}, text="Abercrombie, the hermit in the shack north-east of the cemetery (28.1,31.5). The ghouls around his hill (24-29) attack on sight: go around the east side", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=28.1, y=31.5, path={{7.7,31.6},{13.1,29.8},{16.3,26.8},{24.9,28.9}}},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={158}, names={"Zombie Juice"}, text="Abercrombie", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=28.1, y=31.5},
  {t="S", seg=11, arg="Darkshire", text="Follow the main road east to Darkshire, a long walk (ravagers and spiders on the road are grey to green). Bind at the Scarlet Raven Tavern (Innkeeper Trelayne)", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=73.9, y=44.4, path={{33.4,24.1},{37.2,25.3},{40.8,19.6},{51.4,18.4},{54.6,20.8},{57.0,20.8},{64.6,33.4},{68.0,36.1},{68.0,42.7},{70.0,46.6},{72.4,46.6}}},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={90}, names={"Seasoned Wolf Kabobs"}, text="Chef Grual, in the same tavern: Seasoned Wolf Kabobs. He already has the herbs: he only needs 10 Lean Wolf Flanks", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=73.8, y=43.5},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={158}, names={"Zombie Juice"}, text="Tavernkeep Smitts, in the tavern", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=73.8, y=44.5},
