  {t="C", seg=11, q={1447}, names={"The Missing Diplomat"}, text="He attacks with two Old Town Thugs (Dashel is level 26). Send the Voidwalker at Dashel, put Corruption, Curse of Agony and Immolate on him and Drain Life: the fight ends when he gives up. Ignore the thugs, or Fear one if they hurt too much", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=74.3, y=59.2},
